<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Shanjo</book>
  <para style="h">Joani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Joa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibuka lya Joani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibuka lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Joani</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Jesu, ijwi lyaconse lya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ku matatikilo, Ijwi nko ka lili. Mi Ijwi no Nyambe ka li kele, mi Ijwi ka lili Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Ka joja no Nyambe ku zwa ku matatikilo. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nyambe sa bumba i bintu byonse ko ku mu litusisa. Takuli i bintu na bya bumbigwa uku ta na ga bumba. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Kwakwe nkoko ku li u bumi mi bobo u bumi nde tuba lyo bantu bonse. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ituba kale lya munika mu kansindwe mi a kansindwe kale ka kangwa uku li zima.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nyambe kale ga tuma unkosi gwezina lya Joani u mukolobezi. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Sa keza ku paka bya lelyo ituba, buti a bantu bonse ba zumine kwa lelyo ituba ko bupaki bwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Joani ta li ndege ka li ituba, ige ka li mpaki uju ka sukulula byetuba.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Lelyo ndituba lyaconse ili ka li keza mwilonga keza ku munikila a bantu bonse. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Sa keza mwilonga ili sa bumba, kono ilonga ta na lya mu zekelela. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Kale ga keza ku bakwakwe kono a bakwakwe ta na ba mu tambula. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kono ku bantu bonse aba na ba mu tambula, kwa ba na ba zumina mwizina lyakwe kale ga ba wa inguzu jo ku ba a bana Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />A ba ta na ba zaligwa ko bu ka shakila u muntu, kampa ko mushakilo go buntu kampa ubu ka shakila unkosi kono ko bu ka shakila Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ijwi kale lya zoka u muntu mi kale ga keza ku joja neswe, mi iswe kale twa bona impazimo jakwe iji ji botele Mwana Nyambe genke, uju na ga zwa kwa Tata na vumbite i cisemo no niti.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Joani ka paka byakwe ku bantu na kugiliza nage, “Joju ndege ka ndi gamba byakwe aa ka ndi tanga buti, ‘Uju a keza mwishule lyangu a la ndi itilila kakuli ige nko ka li ku zwa koko ku nkulu-katanzi ime na ndi sini uku bako.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Mu muvumbilila gwakwe, twense na twa tambula imfwijaguzi jo cisemo ci ita ici ka ci liko. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kakuli u mulao se gu wegwa ku bantu ko ku litusisa Mushe, kono i cisemo no niti na bya keza ko ku litusisa Jesu u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Takuli uju ga la bona Nyambe, mbwita Mwana Nyambe genke bulyo mi nage kame ndi Nyambe, ndege genke bulyo a li afuwi no Nyambe Isi mi na ga mu zibaaza.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa gamba buti ta li nde Mushaligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Male 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Ubu mbo bupaki bwa Joani a bakulu bo Majuda ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema aa na ba tuma a mapulisiti no Malivi buti ba ka mu buze buti, “Ndigweni?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Joani kale ga ba taba wawa nage, “Ime ta li ndime Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Abo kale ba mu buza kame nabo, “Elu ndigweni? Ndigwe Eliya?” Joani kale ga ba taba nage, “Ntali ndime.” Kale ba mu buza kame nabo, “U li muboni gwa Nyambe?” Joani kale ga ba taba nage, “Inga.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Kale ba mu buza kame nabo, “Ndigweni? U tu tabe buti tu ka lugule kwa ba ba la tu tumi. Mbuti u co, buti ndigweni?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Joani kale ga ba taba ko majwi aga sa gamba u muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya nage,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 1:23" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Ndime jwi lyo muntu a kugiliza mu mangusu li ta buti, ‘Mu golole inzila jo Mfumu.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isaya 40:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />A Bafalisi aba na ba ka tumigwa, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ati ta li ndigwe Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe kampa Eliya kampa u muboni gwa Nyambe, ncinzi aa u kolobeza?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Joani kale ga taba nage, “Ime kame ndi kolobeza ko menzi, kono nkwali uju a zimene mukati kenu uju ta mu zekelele. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ndege na tende u musebezi mwishule lyangu, buti mane ta ndi goli uku shumununa u tushuminiso to nshangu jakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Bebyo byonse, mwilonga lya Bbetaniya mwisilya limwinya lyo Lwizi lwa Joodani ka bi tendaalila, u mu ka kele Joani na kolobeza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa paka bya Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ijuba na lya nungako, Joani kale ga bona Jesu na keza aa ka li mi kale ga ta nage, “Nga mu lole, Ingu-gana ja Nyambe, uju a inda i bitendantu i bimangoju byo bantu bonse ba mwilonga! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ndege ka ndi gamba byakwe aa ka ndi ta buti, ‘Nkwali unkosi uju a keza mwishule lyangu, ige a la ndi ita kakuli nko ka li ku zwa koko ku nkulu-katanzi, ime na ndi sini uku bako.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Neme ta ka ndi mwizi kono ici ci ndi kolobezisa a bantu ko menzi, nku ta buti a ganunwe ku bantu ba Isilaele.”<figure style="fig" alt="John declares Jesus is the Lamb of God" file="wa03813b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 1:29-31" ref="1:29-31">Joani aa ta buti Jesu ne Ngu-gana ja Nyambe</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Mi Joani ka paka nage, “Ndi la boni u Moya go Kucena gu zwa kwigulu na gu bonaala sinagwe nu nziba no keza ku kala akwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Neme ta na ndi la mu zibi, kono uju na ga ndi tuma buti ndi kolobeze a bantu ko menzi, ndege sa ndi lugwila buti, ‘Unkosi uju no bone u Moya go Kucena gu sezumukila no ku kala akwe, ndege na kolobeze ko Moya go Kucena.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Na nda bona ku tendaala bulyao kwakwe mi nda sa paka buti nde Mwana Nyambe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolelwe buti “Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe”.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bazigigwa ba Jesu betanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ijuba na lya nungako, Joani aa ka zimene ao kame no bo bile bo bazigigwa bakwe, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />kale ga bona Jesu na ita, mi kale ga ta nage, “Nga mu lole Ingu-gana ja Nyambe!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Babo a bazigigwa bo bile aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba umpilila Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Jesu aa litemuna, kale ga ba bona na ba mu umpilile, mi kale ga ba buza nage, “Ncinzi mu shaka?” Abo kale ba mu taba nabo, “Rabbi” (ku toloka buti, “Muzigi”), “Kwibo u kalanga?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu keze mi kuti mu bone.” Abo kale ba ka ja mi kale ba ka bona uku ka kalanga. Se ka ji li inako jo ma 16 jo matengu mi kale ba kala nage lelyo ijuba. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andileya, mwancegwe gwa Simoni Pitolosi ka li jumwinya go bankosi bo bile aba na ba shugwa ibi ka ta Joani mi kale ga umpilila Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />I cintu ce tanzi ici na ga tenda Andileya, nku shaka-shaka mukulwe Simoni no ku mu ta buti, “Tu la gwani u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe” (ku toloka “Kilesite”).<verse eid="JHN 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Andileya kale ga leta Simoni kwa Jesu. Jesu kale ga lolelela Simoni mi kale ga ta nage, “Ndigwe Simoni mwana Joani, kono kuti u kugigwange Kefasi” (ku toloka “Pitolosi”).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kuga Filipi no Natanaele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ijuba ili na lya nungako, Jesu kale ga gaja uku ja kwilonga lya Galileya. Kale ga gwana Filipi mi kale ga mu ta nage, “U keze u ndi umpilile.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipi ka li gwa mu munzi gwa Bbesaida, mu munzi u mu ka ba kalanga ba Andileya no Pitolosi.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipi kale ga gwana Natanaele mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Tu la gwani u muntu uju sa ñola Mushe mu mabuka go mulao, mane noju na ba ñola a baboni ba Nyambe, ndi Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, mwana Josefa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaele kale ga mu buza nage, “Mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta? Ncintunzi i cilotu ici ci gola uku zwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipi kale ga mu ta nage, “U keze u ka li bonene.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Jesu aa bona Natanaele na keza, kale ga ta nage, “Joju ndo Muisilaele wawa uju ta azi ku manya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaele kale ga mu buza nage, “Mbuti u ndi zibile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndi la ku boni no li mwisiko lyo cishamu co mulya-nshwi, Filipi na sini ka ku kuga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Mi Natanaele kale ga mu ta nage, “Muzigi, ndigwe mwana Nyambe mi u li Mfumu go bantu ba Isilaele.”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Gwa sa zumina kebaka lyo ku ta buti ndi la kuti buti ndi la ku boni no li mwisiko lyo cishamu co mulya-nshwi! Kuti no bone i bintu i binene ku ita byebyo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Jesu kale ga mu ta kame nage, “Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila, kuti no bone igulu li galuka no mañiloi ga Nyambe ga kambama no ku sezumukila egulu lyangu ime nde Mwana Muntu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwana muntu ncitulo ka litusisanga Jesu uku li kuga gemwini.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">U mukiti go maseswa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Mwijuba lya tatu kale kwa ba no mukiti go maseswa mu munzi gwa Kana, gwa mwilonga lya Galileya. Nyina gwa Jesu mpo ka li, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />mi Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba kugigwa nabo koko ku mukiti. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Waine aa sa la mani, nyina gwa Jesu kale ga ta Jesu nage, “A bantu ba la maninwa waine.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Maa, Mbya cinzi byebyo kwangu? Inako jangu ji sini ku sika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Nyina kale ga ta a baika nage, “Ibi sa ka mi tele byonse mu bi tende!”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Afuwi no ao, ka ku ninzi u tuzunga twa 6 to ku bumba a mabwe, u mu ka ba shambilanga a Majuda ku umpilila i cizo cabo. A kazunga konke ka ka gola uku vumba a menzi ga cikimika u mungomo. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Jesu kale ga ta a baika nage, “Mu tekelele a menzi momu mu tuzunga” mi kale ba tu vumba mbwita ku milomo. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Mi Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Cwale mu vwetemo mu twalile u mujendesi go mukiti.” Kale ba tenda bulyao.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus turns water into wine" file="dn00453b.jpg" size="span" loc="Jhn 2:5-10" copy="Dunham" ref="2:5-10">Jesu aa zola a menzi ku ga tenda waine</figure><verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />U mujendesi go mukiti kale ga shutulamo ku jeleka a menzi aga na ga zoligwa ku ba waine. Mi ko ku sa ziba uku ka zwa waine, mbwita bulyo a baika aba na ba teka a menzi mbabo ka be zi, kale ga kugila u musesi kumbali. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Kale ga mu ta nage, “A bantu bonse ndi waine u mulotu ba wanga a bantu ba la kugigwa, mi aa se ba la nywi lwini, nela sa la ba wa waine u mushamu, kono igwe no li bikile waine u mulotu ku twala ku mamaninino.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ceci nce cijuliko ci makaza ce tanzi sa tenda Jesu mu munzi gwa Kana gwa mwilonga lya Galileya mi kale ca bonisa impazimo jakwe mi a bazigigwa bakwe kale ba zumina kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />U mukiti aa se gu la mani, Jesu kale ga ja no nyina, no bancegwe mane no bazigigwa bakwe, mi kale ba ja mu munzi gwa Kapenauma no ka kalamo a majuba a mace bulyo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa cenesa u tumpetu to tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Male 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Inako jo Mukiti go Majuda go Mpaseka aa se ka ji li afuwi, Jesu kale ga ja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mu tumpetu twa kunze jo tempele,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I tempele ni njugo inene ja Nyambe iji ka ji gwanaala bulyo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema u mu ka ba lapelelanga a Maisilaele. Ka ba zuminanga buti Nyambe mwali momo mu njugo.</char></note> Jesu kale ga ka gwana a bantu aba ka ba gulisa iñombe, ingu no tunkwilimba, bamwinya na ba zelite a matafule na ba cinca a masheleñi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Jesu kale ga tenda i cime ko miala, no ku ba tandila kunze jo tumpetu to tempele. Mi kale ga gundumuna iñombe, nongu, no ku gwisa a matafule gabo ku mwaga a masheleñi go bantu aba ka ba cinca a masheleñi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Kwa ba ka ba gulisa u tunkwilimba, Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu tu zwise mo muno! Mu leke uku zola injugo ja Tata a magulikizo!”<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba gaja ubu ku ñolelwe mu Mañolo buti, “U lushako lwangu u lunene lo ku kala mu njugo jako, kuti na lu ndi tente mu mojo gwangu sinagwe mulilo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Nimbo 69:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />A bajendesi bo Majuda kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ncijuliko ca buti ici u botele uku tu sunda buti u li kwesi inguzu jo ku tenda bulyaa?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu jakulule jeji i tempele, mi kuti na ndi ji jake mu majuba go tatwe bulyo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Abo kale ba mu taba nabo, “Buti? I tempele na twa jaka mu myaka ja 46, igwe njejo u ta buti kuti no ji jake mu majuba go tatwe bulyo?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kono Jesu i tempele ka ta, ka gu li mubili gwakwe, <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />mi aa sa la buki ku zwa ku bafu, a bazigigwa bakwe kale ba vuluka a majwi aga sa gamba mi kale ba zumina ibi bi ñoletwe mu Mañolo no ku zumina a majwi gakwe.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a li zi a bantu bonse</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Jesu aa ka sili mu munzi gwa Jelusalema ku Mukiti go Mpaseka, a bantu a bangi kale ba zumina mwizina lyakwe aa ba bona i bijuliko ibi ka tenda. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Kono Jesu kale ga kangwa uku ba sepa kakuli ka zekelele a bantu bonse. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ta ka zunda u muntu uku mu gambaguza byo mukalilo go bantu, kakuli ka zekelele u muntu no muntu ubu a kalile mu mojo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no nkosi ka kugigwa Nekudema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Nko ka li unkosi ka kugigwa Nekudema, uju ka li Mufalisi mi ka li jumwinya go bajendesi bo nkuta inene jo Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kale ga keza kwa Jesu a masiku no keza ku mu ta nage, “Muzigi, tu li zekelele buti u li muzigi uju a zwa kwa Nyambe. Kakuli takuli uju a gola uku tenda i bijuliko ibi bi makaza u kwesi uku tenda ati Nyambe ta kele nage.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Mbyaconse wawa ndi ku lugwila buti, takuli u muntu a gola uku bona u mubuso gwa Nyambe ati ta la bonegwa lyabili kame.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nekudema kale ga buza Jesu nage, “U muntu mbuti a gola uku bonenwa lyabili kame uku sa li kulite? A bogole mwivumo lya nyina buti a bonegwe lyabili?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Jesu kale ga mu taba kame nage, “Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila buti takuli u muntu uju na ngine mu mubuso gwa Nyambe ati ta bonegwa ko menzi no ko Moya. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />U muntu, muntu kame a gola uku zala, mi Moya bulyo gwa Nyambe gu gola uku zola u muntu buti a be mwana Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />U leke uku komokwa aa ndi ku ta buti ‘Mu li botele uku bonegwa lyabili.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Inkuli ji la ku unganga ku tunguluza uku ji shaka konse. Igwe mbulyo u gola uku shugwa ijaba lyo ku unga kwajo, kono to goli uku ziba uku ji zwa kampa uku ji ja. Mbobo ku kalile no ku muntu uju a la bonegwa ko Moya.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nekudema kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Mbuti bi gola uku tendaalila byebyo?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U li muzigi go bantu ba Isilaele kanti negwe to bi shugwilisi byebi i bintu? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Mbyaconse wawa ndi ku lugwila buti, iswe tu li bo ku gambanga i bintu tu zekelele, mi tu la ku paka ibi na twa bona, kono inwe mwe bantu ta mu tambuli u bupaki bwetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ndi la ku gambaguzi i bintu bya mwilonga kono to la zumini, mbuti u gola uku zumina aa ndi ku gambaguza i bintu bya kwigulu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Takuli u muntu sa ja kwigulu mbwita ime nde Mwana Muntu na nda zwa kwigulu. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Sinagwe ndi Mushe ubu sa angikila ijoka mu mangusu, neme nde Mwana Muntu ndi li botele uku angikigwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />buti u muntu gense uju a zumina kwangu na gwane u bumi ta bu mani.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />“Kakuli Nyambe sa shaka lwini ilonga mane kale ga li wa Mwane genke, buti u muntu gense uju a zumina kwakwe na leke uku fwa kono na gwane u bumi ta bu mani. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kakuli Nyambe ta sa tuma Mwane mwilonga buti a keze a atule ilonga, kono buti a keze a jojese ilonga.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“U muntu gense uju a zumina kwakwe ta na atuligwe, kono u muntu gense uju ta zumini kwakwe, sa li atulitwe kakuli ta na ga zumina mwizina lya Mwana Nyambe genke. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Mi inkatulo nji jeji. Ituba na lya keza mwilonga, kono a bantu na ba shaka a kansindwe ku ita ituba kakuli i bitendantu byabo ka bi li bimangoju. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />U muntu gense uju a tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju ngwa ku zimba ituba, mi ta goli uku keza mwituba kebaka lyo bujoge buti i bitendantu i bimangoju byakwe mane bi bonaazwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kono u muntu uju a joja mu niti ga sa keza mwituba, buti ku bonaale wawa buti ibi na ga tenda kame ka bi tenda Nyambe na mu wene.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya na ga ñola a majwi ga Joani mu ntimana ja 16 ku twala nku ntimana ja 21.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joani aa paka bya Jesu kame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ja mu cibaka ka ci li mwilonga lya Judeya, u mu na ba ka kala inako inde na ba kolobeza.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Joani u mukolobezi nage ka kwesi uku kolobeza a bantu mu cibaka ici ka ci kugigwa Enoni afuwi no munzi gwa Salimi, kakuli a menzi momo ka ga ngiite mi a bantu ka ba keza kwakwe na ba kolobezigwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Bebyo ka bi tendaala Joani u mukolobezi na sini uku tuligwa mu ntolongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kale kwa buka inkani mukati ko bazigigwa bamwinya ba Joani no jumwinya u muntu go Mujuda. Kame ka ba li kanana a ntaba jo ku shamba no ku li cenesa ko cizo. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Kale ba keza kwa Joani no keza ku mu ta nabo, “Muzigi, ngo lole julya unkosi uju ko paka byakwe, uju ka ka kele negwe mwisilya lyo Lwizi lwa Joodani, nage sa li kwesi uku kolobeza, mi a bantu bonse nkwakwe se ba manina.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Joani kale ga ba taba nage, “U muntu ta goli uku tenda i cintu ici ta na ga mu wa Nyambe gwa kwigulu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Inwe wawa mu la gola uku ndi pakila buti ka ndi tanga buti, ‘Ime ta li ndime Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe kono mbulyo se ndi tumigwa uku li tangiza kwakwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />U musesi ngwa musesigwa. U musele go musesi mbulyo a keza ku mu tusa, mbulyo a lindila no ku tegeleza, mi sa la jangala aa shugwa ijwi lyo musesi. Mi koko uku jangala nkwangu, mi aano se ku li vumbite. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ige a li botele uku ba u munene, ime ndi kujuke.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Ige nkwigulu a zwa mi a li botele uku ba egulu lyo bantu bonse, kono uju a zwa mwilonga ngwelonga mi mbyelonga a gamba. Uju a zwa kwigulu mpegulu lyo bantu bonse a li. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ga sa paka i bintu byonse ibi na ga bona no ku shugwa, kono takuli u muntu uju a tambula u bupaki bwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />U muntu gense uju sa tambula no ku zumina bobo u bupaki na ga paka wawa buti Nyambe ngwa niti. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Kakuli uju sa tumigwa kwa Nyambe, ga sa gamba a majwi ga Nyambe kakuli Nyambe ga sa mu wa u Moya ko bungi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tata a la shaka Mwane mi sa wa i bintu byonse mu nguzu jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />U muntu gense uju a zumina kwa Mwana Nyambe a li kwesi u bumi ta bu mani, kono u muntu gense uju a kana Mwana Nyambe ta na bone u bumi, kakuli u bukali bwa Nyambe se bu lili egulu lyakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no mwanakazi go Musamaliya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Jesu kale ga nangula buti a Bafalisi na ba shugwa buti sa li kwesi a baumpilili a bangi aba sa kolobezite ku ita Joani u mukolobezi. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Nangezo ta li ndi Jesu wawa ka kolobeza a bantu kono mbazigigwa bakwe ka ba ba kolobeza. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Kale ga zwa mwilonga lya Judeya no ku bogola kwilonga lya Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kale ga jenda mu nzila ka ji itila mwilonga lyo Masamaliya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Mi se ka kokelele afuwi no munzi gwa Sikale ugu ka gu li mwilonga lya Samaliya afuwi negwa lya Jakobo ili sa wa mwane gwezina lya Josefa, <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />aa kakuli ikalo lya Jakobo. Jesu uju se ka kotele kebaka lyo lujendo u lule, kale ga kala ao ekalo. Se ka ku li kamwi mi se ka ku ja bu tukuta. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />U mwanakazi go Musamaliya kale ga keza ku ku teka a menzi, mi Jesu kale ga mu kumbila nage, “Ngo ndi we ku menzi ndi nywe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu se ka ba jite momo mu munzi ka gula i bilyo.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and a Samaritan woman" file="dn00433b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 4:7-10" copy="Dunham" ref="4:7-10">Jesu no mwanakazi go Musamaliya</figure><verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />U mwanakazi go Musamaliya kale ga mu taba nage, “Igwe u li Mujuda, ime ndi li mwanakazi go Musamaliya. Ncinzi aa u ndi kumbila a menzi go ku nywa?” Kakuli a Majuda ta ba kwesi i ngwanano no Masamaliya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ka li no zekelele impo ja Nyambe mane neme ndi ku kumbila a menzi, ndigwe no la ndi kumbili mi na ndi la ku wi a menzi ga joja.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga mu taba nage, “Mfumwangu, to kwesi i citekiso mi kame ne kalo ndya ku noka. Kwibo so ko gwane gaga a menzi ga joja? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Igwe negwe u li munene ku ita Isetu Jakobo uju sa li tu wa leli ikalo, mi momo ka nywanga ige no bane mane no bimunantu byakwe bulyao?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U muntu gense uju a nywa gaga a menzi kuti na shugwe inyotwa kame, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />kono u muntu gense uju a nywa ku menzi aga ndi mu wa, ta na shugwe inyotwa kame. A menzi aga ndi mu wa kuti na ga zoke ikalo li zwetela a menzi go bumi ta bu mani mukati kakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Mfumwangu, u ndi we gago a menzi buti ndi leke uku shugwanga inyotwa. Izo ndi leke uku li yazanga u keza ku tekanga a menzi ko kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U jende u ka kuge unkosi gwako mu ka keze ko kuno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga mu taba nage, “Ta ndi kwesi unkosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U la gambi nenja aa u la ti buti to kwesi unkosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kakuli so sesegwa ku bankosi ba 5 mi unkosi uju u kwesi aano, ta li nde nkosi gwako wawa. Ibi u la gambi mbyaconse.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ige kale ga mu ta nage, “Mfumwangu, ndi liwene buti u li muboni gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Basukuzetu ba ku kale ka ba lapelelanga Nyambe a leli ilundu, kono inwe mwe Majuda mbuti mu co buti mu munzi gwa Jelusalema momo tu botele uku lapelelanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Jesu kale ga taba jojo u mwanakazi nage, “Mwanakazi, u zumine kwangu, kakuli inako ji la keza aa na mu leke uku lapelelanga Isetu Nyambe a leli ilundu kampa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Inwe mwe Masamaliya ta mwi zi ibi mu lapela, kono iswe twe Majuda ndiswe tu zekelele ibi tu lapela kakuli injojeso nku Majuda ji zwila. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kono inako ji la keza mane na ja sika a balapeli bo niti aa na ba lapele Nyambe Tata ko Moya no ko niti, kakuli a balapeli ba bulyao mbabo a shaka Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nyambe Moya, mi na ba ba mu lapela ba li botele uku mu lapela ko Moya no ko niti.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga ta nage, “Ndi li zekelele buti u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, uju a kugigwa Kilesite, a la keza. Mi aa na sike ndege na tu tansulwile i bintu byonse.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Mi Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ndime Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe ime ndi gambagula negwe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Momo mu nako a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba ka bogola mi kale ba komokwa aa ba mu gwana na gambagula no jojo u mwanakazi. Kono takuli uju na ga mu buza buti, “Mbinzi u shaka?” kampa “Ncinzi aa u gambagula nage?” <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga leka a kazunga kakwe ko menzi no ku bogola ku munzi ka lugwila a bantu nage, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mu keze mu bone unkosi uju a la ndi gambaguzi i bintu byonse ibi na nda tenda. Izo nde Mushaligwa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />A bantu kale ba zwa mu munzi no keza kwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />A bantu aa ka ba keza, a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba mu indikiza nabo, “Muzigi, u lye cimwinya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ndi li kwesi i bilyo ndi lya ibi ta mwi zi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Izo nkwali u muntu a la mu leteli i bilyo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “I bilyo byangu, nku tenda ubu a shakila uju na ga ndi tuma mane no ku mana u musebezi gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ta li mu la ku tanga buti, ‘Ku si sigalile i myezi jone buti a bantu ba zimbule’? Kono nda sa mi lugwila buti, mu tonde mi mu lolese nenja u lugwa kakuli u lukau se lu li botele uku zimbuligwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />U muntu gense uju a zimbula, ga sa wegwa u mupuzo mi ga sa zimbula u lukau lo bumi ta bu mani, buti u mubyali no muzimbuli ba jangalile antu-onke. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Se ku tegwa buti, ‘Jumwinya mubyali, mi jumwinya muzimbuli’ mi gogo u mugambilo ngwaconse. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Na nda mi tuma uku zimbula ibi ta na mwa byala. Bamwinya na ba sebeza lwini wawa, inwe na mwa zimbula bu jangele ibi na ba sebeza.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Masamaliya aa ba zumina</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />U bungi bo Masamaliya aba ka ba zwa mwa gogo u munzi kale ba zumina kwa Jesu kebaka lyo bupaki bwa jojo u mwanakazi aa sa ba ta buti, “A la ndi lugwili i bintu byonse ibi na nda tenda.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Mi a Masamaliya aa se ba la kezi ku mu bona, kale ba mu kumbila buti a kale nabo, mi Jesu kale ga kala nabo a majuba go bile. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Mi kebaka lyo majwi gakwe, u bungi bwabo kale ba zumina. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Kale ba ta jojo u mwanakazi nabo, “Ta tu si zumini kebaka lyebi u la tu gambaguzi, kono tula mu li shugwili neswe mi tu li zi buti joju unkosi, ndiconse nde Mujojesi gwelonga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza u mwana mubusisi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba go bile, Jesu kale ga ja kwilonga lya Galileya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ige wawa Jesu sa gamba buti takuli u muboni gwa Nyambe a kutikigwa mu munzi gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Aa ka sika mwa Galileya, a bantu kale ba ka mu tambula, kakuli na ba bona i bintu byonse ka tenda mu munzi gwa Jelusalema a Mukiti go Mpaseka kakuli nabo mpo ka ba li.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Jesu kale ga ka pota kame no mu munzi gwa Kana ugu ka gu li mwilonga lya Galileya, u mu sa zola a menzi ku ga tenda waine. Momo mu munzi gwa Kapenauma mo ka li u mubusisi uju ka kwesi mwane uju ka li mulwele. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Jojo u mubusisi aa shugwa buti Jesu na ga ka zwa mwilonga lya Judeya mi sa li li mwilonga lya Galileya, kale ga mu jila no ka mu kumbila lwini buti aka oze mwane uju se ka shaka uku fwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Mwe bantu ta mu goli uku zumina bulyo mbwita aa mu bona i bijuliko no bintu bi komokwisa?”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Jojo u mubusisi kale ga mu ta bulyo nage, “Mfumwangu, ndokweni aano mwanangu na sini uku fwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U bogole, mwano kuti a joje.” Ige kale ga zumina a majwi ga Jesu mi kale ga bogola.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Aa ka si jenda mu nzila bulyao, kale ga shangana a baika bakwe aba ka ba mu jila ka mu ta buti mwane na ga lwaluka mi sa li kele nenja. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Jojo u mubusisi aa ba buza inako na ga lwaluka, kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ndijona ko nako ja 1 jo kamwi ielenge mpaa na lya mu leka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Isi kale ga ziba buti ne nako wawa Jesu aa na ga mu ta buti, “Mwano kuti a joje.” Jojo unduna no bantu bo luasi lwakwe bonse kale ba zumina kwa Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ceci nce cijuliko cabili ici na ga tenda Jesu ku zwa aa na ga sikila mwilonga lya Galileya na ka zwila kwilonga lya Judeya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi ku kaziba</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Aa na kwa ita inako inde, Jesu kale ga kambamina ku munzi gwa Jelusalema, ku mukiti gumwinya go Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Momo mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mo ka ka li a kaziba aka ka kugigwa Bbetesida mu mushobo go Ciebelu, afuwi no Manginino go Ngu, aka ka ka jakilwe u tujugo twa 5 tu kwesi a malibela ga sungamine momo mu kaziba. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Momo mo ka ku lalanga a balwele a bangi, a baofu, bo ku kubala i bilama, no bo ku golomena i mibili aba ka ba lindile uku selauka ko menzi. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kakuli a mwinya iñiloi lyo Mfumu Nyambe, ka li sezumukilangamo no ku selagula a menzi, mi u mulwele uju ka li tangiza uku sezumukila momo mu kaziba a menzi na ga selauka, ka lwaluka ku bulwele bonse ubu ka lwala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka go Cigelike gamwinya no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi intimana ja 4.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Mo ka li unkosi momo uju na ga lwala a myaka ja 38. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Jesu aa mu bona na lele, kale ga ziba buti na ga inda inako inde na lwala bulyao. Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “U la shaka uku lwaluka?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />U mulwele kale ga mu taba nage, “Mfumwangu, ndi li bulite u muntu uju a ndi tusa uku ndi sezumwina mu kaziba a menzi na ga selauka. Ndi la ku jelekanga uku sezelangamo kono aa ndi seza, jumwinya sa la ndi tanta.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Cwale Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Zimana! U inde ishasha lyako mi u jende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Aobulyo jojo unkosi kale ga lwaluka, mi kale ga inda ishasha lyakwe na ka li jila. Kalili ijuba lyo Nsabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijuba lyo bu 7 mu nsunda, ili ta ka ba sebezanga a Majuda na ba lapela Nyambe mi mu Cishanjo ndya Mukibelo kampa ijuba lyo ku wisa.</char></note> aa ka bi tendaala byebyo, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />mi a bajendesi a bakulu bo Majuda kale ba ta jojo unkosi na ga lwaluka nabo, “Shunu ndya Nsabata mi u mulao gwa sa kanisa uku inda ishasha lyako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ige kale ga ba taba nage, “Unkosi uju a la ndi ozi ndege a la ndi ti buti, ‘Inda ishasha lyako mi u jende.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ndini jojo unkosi uju a la kuti buti u inde ishasha no ku ta buti u jende?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Jojo unkosi na ga lwaluka kale ga kangwa uku ziba buti ndini wawa kakuli Jesu na ga ja bu yongobela mukati ko bantu a bangi aba ka ba lio. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Aa na kwa ita inako, Jesu kale ga ka gwana jojo unkosi mu tempele mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Ngo lole, u la lwaluki. U zwe ku bitendantu i bimangoju buti i cintu i cimangoju wawa mane na ci tendaale kwako.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Jojo unkosi kale ga ka lugwila a bajendesi bo Majuda buti ndi Jesu a la mu ozi.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguzu ja Mwana Nyambe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kebaka lyo ku ta buti Jesu ndya Nsabata na ga tenda byebyo i bintu, a bajendesi bo Majuda kale ba tatika uku pengisa Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Mu ku li lamwina kwakwe, Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Tata mwijuba-mwijuba a sebeza, mi neme nda sa sebeza.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kebaka lelyo, kale ba jeleka wawa uku shaka a kaito buti ba mu yage. Kakuli ta ka shwauza ijuba lyo Nsabata bulyo kono kame ka kuga Nyambe buti Ndisi wawa, ku li tenda u muntu a jelekelele no Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Jesu kale ga ba lugwila kame nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti ime nde Mwana ta ndi goli uku li tendela i bintu kangu bulyo, mbulyo ndi gola uku tenda ibi ndi bona kwa Tata na bi tenda. I bintu byonse a tenda Tata, neme nde Mwana mbebyo ndi gola uku tenda. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kakuli Tata a la ndi shaka ime nde Mwane mi ga sa ndi sunda ibi a tenda byonse. Ee, mane ga sa ndi sunda i misebezi i minene ku ita jeji mu la boni buti mu komokwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kakuli sinagwe ndi Tata aa busa a bafu no ku ba wa u bumi, neme nde Mwane ndi la wa u bumi ku bantu bonse aba ndi shaka buti ndi bu ba we. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ku zwao kame, Tata ta atuli u muntu, kono na ga ndi wa inguzu ime nde Mwane jo ku atula, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />buti a bantu bonse ba ndi kutike ime nde Mwana sinagwe ubu ba kutikila Tata. Uju ta ndi kutiki ime nde Mwana, ta kutiki no Tata uju na ga ndi tuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Mbyaconse wawa ndi mi lugwila buti, u muntu aa shugwa ijwi lyangu no ku zumina kwoju na ga ndi tuma, a li kwesi u bumi ta bu mani mi ta na atuligwe kono na ga shatuka ku zwa mu lufu ku ja mu bumi.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />“Mbyaconse wawa ndi mi lugwila buti, inako ji la keza mane na ja sika a bafu aa na ba shugwe ijwi lya Mwana Nyambe. Mi aba na ba li shugwe, kuti na ba joje. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kakuli sinagwe ndi Tata aa jojesa a bantu, na ga ndi zuminina neme nde Mwane buti ndi jojese a bantu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Mi na ga ndi wa inguzu jo ku atula kakuli ndime Mwana Muntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mu leke uku komokwa aa ndi ta bulyao kakuli inako ji la keza a bafu bonse aba ba li mu mabita aa na ba shugwe ijwi lyangu <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />no ku zwamo. A bantu aba na ba tenda i bintu i bilotu kuti na ba buke no ku joja, mi aba na ba tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju kuti na ba bukile inkatulo. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Ime bulyo, takuli ibi ndi gola uku tenda ndenke kono nda sa atula bulyo ku ja ko bu ndi shugwila kwa Tata, mi inkatulo jangu ji li lulikile. Kakuli ta ndi shaki buti ndi tende ibi bi ndi jangaza ndemwini kono buti ndi jangaze uju sa ndi tuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bampaki ba Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Aa ndi li pakila ndemwini u bupaki bwangu mbwa manya. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Kono ndi li kwesi umpaki gwangu, mi ndi li zi buti u bupaki bwakwe mbwa niti. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Se mu tuma a bantu kwa Joani u mukolobezi ka shakisisa byangu mi ige na ga ka paka initi. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Ta ndi zundi u bupaki ubu bu zwa ku bantu, kono nda sa gamba ku ja ko bupaki bwa Joani u mukolobezi buti mu jojeswe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Joani ka kozete sinagwe ndi lambi a munika no ku wa ituba, mi na mwa shala ituba lyakwe buti mu li li kole mu nako imfuwi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Kono ndi si kwesi u bupaki u bunene bu ita bwa Joani u mukolobezi. Mbupaki bo misebezi iji na ga ndi wa Nyambe buti ndi ji maninine mi njejo ji paka buti Tata sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Mi Tata uju na ga ndi tuma, nage na ga paka byangu. Ta mwa la shugwa ijwi lyakwe kampa ku bona ubu a kalile, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />nanga ndijwi lyakwe ta li kwesi u bukalo mukati kenu kakuli ta mu zumini ku muntu uju na ga tuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />“Mu la li ziga bya mu Mañolo lwini kakuli ngago mu gaja buti momo mu gola uku gwana u bumi ta bu mani. Gaga ngo Mañolo aga ga paka byangu, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />kono mwa sa kana uku keza kwangu buti mu gwane u bumi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Ime ta ndi tambuli uku lumbigwa uku ku zwa ku bantu, <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />kono ndi li mi zekelele. Ndi li zi buti ta mu kwesi u lushako lwa Nyambe mu myojo jenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ime na nda keza mwizina lya Tata, ta na mwa ndi tambula, kono ati u muntu na keza mwizina lyakwe, ige kuti na mu mu tambule. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mbuti mu golela uku zuminina uku na mu lilumba-lumba mwalyenu, kono ta mu shaki uku lumbigwa uku ku zwila kwa Nyambe genke?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Mu leke uku gaja buti kuti ndi mi gwanise u mulandu kwa Tata, uju a mi gwanisa u mulandu ndi Mushe, uju mu sepete. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ka li na mu la zumini Mushe, neme ka mu ndi zumina kakuli Mushe mbyangu ka ñola. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Kono kakuli ta mu zumini ibi sa ñola, mbuti sa ka mu zuminine ibi ndi gamba?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa wa a bantu ba 5,000 u buobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Male 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Aa se bi la mani byebyo, Jesu kale ga lutila kwikamba inene lyeziba lya kule no ao lya mwilonga lya Galileya, ili ka li kugigwa iziba inene wawa lya Tibbeliyasi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Mi a bantu a bangi kale ba mu umpililako kakuli na ba bona i bijuliko ibi bi makaza ibi ka tenda byo ku oza aba ka ba lwala. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Jesu kale ga kambama a nkambamo jelundu mi kale ga ka kala ansi no bazigigwa bakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />U Mukiti go Majuda go Mpaseka aa se ka gu li afuwi, <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Jesu kale ga lola no ku bona a bantu a bangi ba tungulwize kwakwe, kale ga ta Filipi nage, “Kwibo sa ka tu gule i bilyo buti tu we baba a bantu ba lye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Mbulyo ka mu buza bulyao ku mu jeleka kakuli Jesu kezi no kale ubu ka botele uku tendela.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipi kale ga mu taba nage, “Nanga na masheleñi aga a gola uku belekela u muntu a myezi ja 6 na tu kwesi mace, i bilyo ka tu gulao mbice buti u muntu no muntu gense a lye nanga nkanunu bulyo!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Jumwinya go bazigigwa bakwe, uju ka kugigwa Andileya, mwancegwe gwa Simoni Pitolosi, kale ga gamba nage, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Nkwali u muninzana uju a kwesi a makoto ga 5 go buobe no tuswi to bile u tununu, kono ncinzi bi gola uku tusa ku bantu a bangi aba ba sika aa?”<figure style="fig" alt="5 barley loaves and 2 fishes" file="gt00094.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 6:7-12" copy="Gordon" ref="6:7-12">Makoto ga 5 go buobe no tuswi to bile</figure><verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe buti, “Mu kalike a bantu ansi.” Mpo kakuli u bwiju u bungi ao a cibaka, mi a bantu kale ba kala ansi. A bankosi bulyo ka ba shaka uku sika a 5,000 aba ka ba lio. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Jesu kale ga inda gago a makoto, mi kale ga litumela, no ku ga taila bonse babo a bantu ka ba kele ku ja ko bu ka ba shakila bonse. Kale ga tenda bulyao no ku tuswi. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bonse aa se ba la mani uku lya ku kuta, Jesu kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Mu gwanike u bubugulusi ubu ba la leki a bantu buti tu leke uku jona cimwinya.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba gwanika u bubugulusi bo buobe na bwa sigala mi kale ba vumba i bitundu bye kumi no byo bile byo buobe na bwa sigala a makoto ga 5 go buobe ubu na ba lya a bantu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />A bantu aa se ba la boni ceco i cijuliko ici naga tenda Jesu, kale ba tatika uku gamba nabo, “Ndiconse joju nde muboni gwa Nyambe uju ka botele u keza mwilonga.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Jesu aa sa la nanguli buti a bantu kame ka ba shaka buti ba mu joboze a bumfumu ko ku mu indikiza, kale ga ba leguka no ku kambamina elundu no ka kalao genke.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa jenda a menzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Male 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Aa se ka kuli a matengu, a bazigigwa ba Jesu kale ba sezumuka kwiziba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />no ka ngina mu bwato mi kale ba shatukila mwisilya lyeziba buti ba je ku munzi gwa Kapenauma. Ijuba kale lya ka gwa mane na ku siya, Jesu na sini uku ba gwana. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Inkuli kale ja unga lwini mi a menzi kale ga tenda a makupezi a manene. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu aa se ba la zugi u lujendo u lule kanunu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbule ka bu shaka uku sika a makilomita ga 5 kampa ga 6.</char></note> kale ba bona Jesu na keza bu kokelela ku bwato na jenda a menzi mi kale ba joga lwini. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kono Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ndime, mu leke uku joga!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Jesu kale ga ngina mu bwato mi a bazigigwa kale ba jangala, mi aobulyo kale ba ka fugika ekamba aa ka ba ja.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu, u buobe bo bumi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ijuba ili na lya nungako, a bantu a bangi aba na ba ka sigala mwisilya lyeziba kale ba nangula buti, u bwato bonke ubu ka bu lio ta bu si a li. No ku ta buti a bazigigwa ba Jesu aa na ba fugula bobo u bwato, Jesu ta na ga longamamo. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Cwale kale kwa sika a mato gamwinya aga ka ga zwa ku munzi gwa Tibbeliyasi. Kale ga fugikila aa na ba lila a bantu a maobe, u Mfumu Jesu aa sa litumela. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />A bantu aa se ba la nanguli buti Jesu ta mu li mane no bazigigwa bakwe bulyao, kale ba longama mwa gago a mato no ku ja ku munzi gwa Kapenauma bu mu shaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Aa se ba la ka mu gwani mwisilya lyeziba, kale ba mu buza nabo, “Muzigi, ni nakonzi na gwa keza ko kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Mbyaconse wawa ndi mi lugwila buti, kame mu ndi shaka kebaka lyo ku ta buti, ta li mpaa na mwa bona i bijuliko kono nkebaka lyo ku ta buti na mwa lya u buobe inwe ku kuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mu leke uku belekela i bilyo ibi bi gola uku mana, kono mu belekele i bilyo ibi bi twala ku bumi ta bu mani ubu ndi gola uku mi wa ime nde Mwana Muntu. Kakuli ndime na ga shala Nyambe Tata mi nkwangu na ga tula u lukanko lo ku zumininwa kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />A bantu kale ba mu buza nabo, “Misebezi ja buti tu botele uku tenda iji a shaka Nyambe?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “U musebezi gwa Nyambe ngu gogu, mu zumine ku muntu uju na ga ka tuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ncijuliko ca buti u tu sunda buti tu ci bone no ku ta buti tu zumine kwako? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Basukuzetu se ba lya imana na ba li mu mangusu, ubu ku ñolelwe buti, ‘Kale ga ba wa u buobe bu zwa kwigulu buti ba lye.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Lujendo 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:15">Neemiya 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Nimbo 78:24</ref>. </char></note> ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbyaconse wawa ndi mi lugwila buti, ta li ndi Mushe sa mi wa u buobe ka bu zwa kwigulu, kono ndi Tata ndege a mi wa u buobe bo niti ubu bu zwa kwigulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kakuli u buobe bwa Nyambe wawa mbu bobu bu zwa kwigulu mi mbobo bu wa u bumi ku bantu ba mwilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />A bantu kale ba mu ta nabo, “Mfumwetu, u tuwange bobo u buobe inako jonse.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Jesu kale ga ba lugwila nage, “Ndime buobe bo bumi. U muntu gense uju a keza kwangu, ta na shugwe injala, mi u muntu gense uju a zumina kwangu ta na shugwe inyotwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kono sinagwe aa na nda mi lugwila na mwa ndi bona, mi kame ta mu zumini kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />A bantu bonse aba a ndi wa Tata, kuti na ba keze kwangu, mi u muntu gense uju a keza kwangu ta na ndi mu tande. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kakuli na nda keza ku zwa kwigulu buti ndi leke keza ku tenda ubu ndi shakila, kono buti ndi tende ubu a shakila uju sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Mi ubu a shakila uju sa ndi tuma nku ta buti, ndi leke ku jobelwa nanga muntu genke ku bantu aba sa ndi wa, kono na ndi ba buse ku ba zwisa ku bafu mwijuba lyo mamaninino. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kakuli Tata ubu a shakila nku ta buti, u muntu gense uju a lolelela kwangu ime nde Mwane no ku ndi zumina, kuti na be no bumi ta bu mani mi ime kuti na ndi mu buse ku mu zwisa ku bafu mwijuba lyo mamaninino.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, a Majuda kale ba tatika uku mu tongauka kakuli Jesu na ga ta buti, “Ndime buobe ubu bu zwa kwigulu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Kale ba ta kame nabo, “Ta li nde Jesu mwana Josefa joju, uju tu zibile besi no nyina bonse? Mbuti a gola uku ta buti, ‘Na nda keza ku zwa kwigulu’?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu leke uku tongauka mukati kenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Takuli u muntu a gola uku keza kwangu mbwita Tata uju sa ndi tuma aa mu leta kwangu mi ime kuti na ndi mu buse ku mu zwisa ku bafu mwijuba lyo mamaninino. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mu Mañolo go baboni ba Nyambe ku li ñoletwe buti, ‘Ndi Nyambe na ba zige bonse.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isaya 54:13</ref>. </char></note> U muntu gense uju na ga shugwa Tata no ku li ziga kwakwe ndege a keza kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Takuli u muntu ga la bona Tata mbwita ime nde Mwane uju na ga zwa kwa Nyambe, ndime ndenke bulyo na nda mu bona.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />“Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila wawa buti, u muntu gense uju a zumina a li kwesi u bumi ta bu mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Ndime buobe bo bumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Basukuzenu se ba lya imana na ba si li mu mangusu, kono se ba fwa bonse. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Kono bo buno mbo buobe bu zwa kwigulu ubu a lya u muntu mi ta fwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Ndime buobe bu joja ubu na bwa zwa kwigulu. U muntu gense uju a lya bobu u buobe, kuti na joje ku twala koko. U mubili gwangu mbo buobe wawa, ubu na ndi we buti bu be u bumi bo bantu ba mwilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Mi a Majuda kale ba tatika uku li kanana mwalyabo nabo, “Uju unkosi mbuti a golela uku tu wa u mubili gwakwe buti tu lye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, aa ta mu li u mubili gwangu ime nde Mwana Muntu no ku nywa a malowa gangu, ta mu kwesi u bumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />U muntu gense uju a lya u mubili gwangu no ku nywa a malowa gangu a li kwesi u bumi ta bu mani, mi kuti na ndi mu buse ku mu zwisa ku bafu mwijuba lyo mamaninino. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kakuli u mubili gwangu ncilyo wawa, no malowa gangu ncinywantu wawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />U muntu gense uju a lya u mubili gwangu no ku nywa a malowa gangu kuti na kalilile kwangu, neme na ndi joje kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Sinagwe ndi Tata uju a joja aa na ga ndi tuma mi ndi la joja kebaka lya Tata, no muntu gense uju a li lela angu kuti na joje kebaka lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ndime buobe ubu se bu zwa kwigulu. Basukuzenu se ba lya imana mi na ba fwa. Kono u muntu gense uju a lya bobu u buobe kuti na joje ku twala koko.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jesu kale ga gamba byebi i bintu byonse aa ka kwesi uku ziga a bantu mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Injugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda, ni njugo u mu ka ba gwananinanga a Majuda, ku bala a mabuka ga Mushe no ku kumbila i bintu kwa Nyambe. Mu Cigelike ka ba ji kuganga i cinagoge.</char></note> ja mu munzi gwa Kapenauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bazigigwa ba Jesu bamwinya aa ba mu leka</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />A bazigigwa ba Jesu bamwinya aa ba shugwa bulyao, kale ba ta nabo, “Jeji inzigo ninkukutu! Ndini a gola uku ji tambula?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Jesu kale ga nangula buti no bazigigwa bakwe ba sa tongauka kebaka lya jejo inzigo. Kale ga ba buza nage, “Nenwe se bi la mi nyegeza byebi i bintu ndi ziga? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Cwale mbuti izo mu bone u Mwana Muntu a kambama no ku bogola uku ka zwa? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />U Moya ngogo gu wa u bumi, u mubili ta gu tusi cimwinya. A majwi ndi la mi gambaguzi nga Moya no bumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kono ndi liwene buti bamwinya mukati kenu ta ba zumini.” Kakuli Jesu kezi ku zwa ku matatikilo buti mbani mukati ko bazigigwa bakwe aba ta ka ba zumina mane kezi noju na mu legeze. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Kale ga ta kame nage, “Mpaa ndi la mi lugwili buti takuli u muntu uju a gola uku keza kwangu mbwita uju na ga wegwa bulyao kwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ku zwa momo mu nako u bungi bo bazigigwa bakwe bamwinya kale ba mu leka no ku li kalila uku jendanga nage. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Jesu kale ga buza a bazigigwa bakwe be kumi no bo bile nage, “Inwe ta mu shaki u ka ja nenwe, indi mbuti?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga mu taba nage, “Mfumwetu, nkwani sa ka tu je? Igwe ndigwe u kwesi a majwi go bumi ta bu mani. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Iswe na twa zumina no ku ziba buti igwe ndigwe go Kucena gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ndime na nda mi shala mwense inwe be kumi no bo bile, kono jumwinya gwenu ndiyauma.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Jesu ndi Judasi mwana Simoni Isikaliota ka ta. Kakuli no ku ka li jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile, ndege na mu legeze.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesu no bancegwe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Jesu kale ga ja bu zimbuluka mwilonga lya Galileya. Ta ka shaka uku ita-ita mwilonga lya Judeya kakuli a bajendesi bo Majuda kame ka ba shaka uku mu yaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Kono u Mukiti go Bikutu go Majuda aa se ka gu li afuwi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />a bancegwe ba Jesu kale ba mu ta nabo, “U zwe mwilonga lya Galileya u je kwilonga lya Judeya buti a bazigigwa bako ba bone i misebezi jako iji u tenda. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Takuli u muntu uju a shaka uku ja impuwo, uju sa ka sebeleze mu buzinda. Ko bintu ibi u tenda, u li bonaaze ku bantu ba mwilonga.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Kakuli no bancegwe wawa ka ba sini ku zumina kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Kebaka lelyo, Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “I nako jangu ji sini ku sika, inwe mu la gola uku jako inako jonse iji mu shaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />A bantu ba mwilonga ta ba goli uku mi zimba, kono ndime ba zimbite kakuli kame ndi lugula buti i misebezi jo bantu mwilonga mimangoju. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mu jende ku mukiti. Ime ta ndi ka ji, kakuli inako jangu ji sini uku sika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Jesu aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga kala bulyo mwilonga lya Galileya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga a bantu a Mukiti go Mpaseka</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Kono a bancegwe ba Jesu aa se ba la nanuki ku ja ku mukiti, Jesu nage kale ga jako, kono mu buzinda buti a bantu ba leke uku mu bona. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Koko ku mukiti, a bajendesi bo Majuda ka ba shiamine Jesu mi ka ba kwesi uku li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Inga Jesu uku a li kwibo?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Mukati ko bantu a bangi, bamwinya ka ba kwesi uku shushutika bya Jesu. Bamwinya ka ba kwesi uku ta buti, “Nu nkosi a kele nenja.” Kono bamwinya ka ba ba taba nabo, “Takuli, mbantu a oma.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kono takuli u muntu uju ka gola uku gambagula bya Jesu nenja akati ko bantu kebaka lyo ku joga a bajendesi bo Majuda.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Akati ko majuba go mukiti, Jesu kale ga ja mu tumpetu to tempele no ka tatika uku ziga a bantu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />A Majuda kale ba komokwa mi kale ba tatika uku li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Mbuti na ga gwanina jonse jeji inzigo uku ta na ga zigigwa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “I bintu ndi ziga ta li mbyangu, nkwa Nyambe bi zwa uju na ga ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />U muntu gense uju a shaka uku tenda ubu a shakila Nyambe kuti na gwane buti ta li mbyangu bulyo ndi ziga kono nkwa Nyambe bi zwa kampa mbyangu ndi li gambila. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />U muntu gense uju a li gambagwila byakwe kame a shaka uku wegwa ikute, kono u muntu uju a shaka buti uju na ga mu tuma a lumbigwe ndo muntu a kwesi initi mi takuli co manya kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ntali ndi Mushe sa mi wa u mulao? Kono takuli nanga njumwinya gwenu uju a kutika u mulao. Ncinzi aa mu ndi ingila uku ndi yaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />A bantu kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ndiyauma li ku munite, uju a ingila uku ku yaga ndini?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Na nda tenda i makazo jonke lyo Nsabata, mi mwense na mwa komokwa lwini. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Kono nenwe mu la ku sebezanga lyo Nsabata ko ku kutika u mulao sa mi wa Mushe go mukanda aa mu twalanga a banuke bo baninzana ku mukanda lyo Nsabata, nanganceciba bulyao, gogo u mulao nko ka gu li ku kale koko mi nku basukuzenu bo kale ka gu zwa mi ta li nkwa Mushe ka gu zwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Cwale ati u mwanuke go muninzana na geguligwa ku mukanda lyo Nsabata, buti u mulao gwa Mushe gu leke uku coligwa, ncinzi aa mu ndi nyegelela aa ndi oza u mulwele lyo Nsabata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mu leke ku atulanga u muntu ubu a bonaalila, kono mu atulange nenja ko niti jo ntaba.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Majuda aa ba yayana <optbreak />kebaka lya Jesu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Aobulyo, a bantu bamwinya ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema kale ba tatika uku gamba nabo, “Ntali nde nkosi joju uju ba ingila uku yaga? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Inga aa li gambagwila bu bugukite akati ko bantu, kono a bantu ta ba kwesi i cigambo kwakwe? Izo a bajendesi na ba zumina buti nde Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe wawa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kono joju unkosi tu li zekelele uku a zwa, kono u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe sa ka na keze, takuli uju na zibe buti uku a zwa nkwibo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Jesu aa ka kwesi uku ziga bulyao mu tumpetu to tempele kale ga gongoza uku gamba nage, “Ee, mu li ndi zi, mane mu li zi no ku ndi zwa. Ntali nka nguzu jangu aa ndi kele aano, kono uju na ga ndi tuma ngwa niti mi ta mu mwizi. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Kono ime ndi li mwizi kakuli nkwakwe na nda zwa mi ndege na ga ndi tuma.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ba shaka buti ba mu kwate, kono takuli uju na ga golola iganja buti a mu kwate kakuli inako jakwe ka ji sini uku sika.<verse eid="JHN 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Nanganceciba, u bungi bo bantu kale ba zumina kwakwe. Kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Izo u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe aa na keze, buti kuti na tende i bijuliko ibi bi makaza i bingi ku ita ibi a tenda joju unkosi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />A Bafalisi kale ba shugwa ibi ka ba shushutika a bantu bya Jesu, mi a mapulisiti a bakulu no Bafalisi kale ba tuma a bamameli bo tempele buti ba ka kwate Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Ndi si kele nenwe inako imfuwi bulyo, mi kuti na ndi bogole kwoju sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Kuti na mu ndi shake, kono ta na mu ndi gwane, mi ta mu goli uku ja uku ndi ja.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />A Majuda kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Uku a shaka uku ja joju unkosi kwibo uku a ta buti ta tu goli u ka mu gwana? Kame a shaka uku ja ku malonga uku ba ka joja bu mwagele a bakwetu aba ba ka joja no Magelike, no ku ziga a Magelike? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mbinzi a la ti aa la gambi buti, ‘Kuti na mu ndi shake kono ta na mu ndi gwane,’ naa la ti buti, ‘Ta mu goli uku ja uku ndi ja’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kuluwiza a menzi ga joja</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mwijuba lyo mamaninino, inene lyo mukiti, Jesu kale ga zimana no ku jankuza kwijwi lwini nage, “Mu leke u muntu gense uju a shugwile inyotwa a keze kwangu a nywe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />U muntu gense uju a zumina kwangu ku ja ko bu na ga tela a Mañolo, kuti na bubise a menzi ga joja ku zwa mu mojo gwakwe sinagwe ndwizi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Jesu aa ka ta bulyao, Moya go Kucena ka ta ugu ba botele uku tambula aba na ba zumina kwakwe. Ku leta jejo inako u Moya ka gu sini uku wegwa kakuli Jesu ka sini uku lumbigwa wawa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku li taa no ku sa zumina ko Majuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Aa ba shugwa gago a majwi, a bantu bamwinya kale ba ta buti, “Ndiconse joju unkosi nde muboni gwa Nyambe uju ka tu lindile.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mulao 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Malaki 4:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Ndi Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe.” Bamwinya kame kale ba buza nabo, “U Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, mbuti a gola uku zwila mwilonga lya Galileya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ntali a Mañolo mbuti ga co buti, u Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe kuti na zwe ku mukoga gwa Deviti na zwe mu munzi gwa Bbeteleema, mu munzi u mu ka joja Deviti?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ko ku tenda bulyao, a bantu kale ba yayana mi kale ba li taa kebaka lya Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamwinya kale ba shaka uku mu kwata, kono takuli uju ka gola uku mu kwata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />A bamameli bo tempele aba na ba tumigwa kale ba bogola ku mapulisiti a bakulu no Bafalisi. Abo kale ba ka ba buza nabo, “Ncinzi aa ta mu la ka mu leti?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />A bamameli bo tempele kale ba taba nabo, “Takuli u muntu uju ga la gamba ko bu a gambila jojo unkosi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />A Bafalisi kale ba ba jukukila nabo, “Kame mu ta buti nenwe a la ka mi omi? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ku manduna no ku Bafalisi, ndini a la ka zumini kwakwe? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Kono baba a bantu a bangi bulyaa aba ta be zi u mulao, mba cikuto.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nekudema uju sa keza kwa Jesu etanzi uju ka li Mufalisi mugenzabo, kale ga ba buza nage, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Izo u mulao gwetu gu la zuminina uku atula u muntu uku ta mu la shugwi tanzi ibi a la gambi no ku bona ibi a la tendi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Abo kale ba mu taba nabo, “Igwe nkwilonga lya Galileya u zwa? U shakisise mi kuti no gwane buti takuli u muboni gwa Nyambe uju na zwe mwilonga lya Galileya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Aobulyo kale ba li taa, u muntu no muntu na ka li jila kwilapa lyakwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka a mangi go Cigelike no mabuka gamwinya ta ga kwesi Joani 7:53–8:11. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kwatila u mwanakazi go cise</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Jesu kale ga ja Kwilundu lya Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />A masiku-siku mwijuba ili na lya nungako, kale ga bogola mu tumpetu to tempele. A bantu a bangi kale ba gwanana, mi Jesu kale ga kala ansi no ku tatika uku ba ziga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Aa ka kwesi uku ba ziga bulyao, a bazigi bo mulao no Bafalisi kale ba leta u mwanakazi kwa Jesu uju na ba kwata na tenda i cise. Kale ba mu zimika mukati ko bantu.<verse eid="JHN 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Kale ba ta Jesu nabo, “Muzigi, tu la gwani joju u mwanakazi na tenda i cise. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />U mulao gwa Mushe mbuti gu co buti u mwanakazi uju a la tendi bulyao a li botele uku yagigwa ko ku sobagulwa ko mabwe. Cwale igwe mbuti u co?”<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Kame ka ba mu buza bulyao buti ba mu gwanineo a kaito ko ku mu shangeza u mulandu. Kono Jesu kale ga kotama, mi kale ga ñola ansi ko munwe gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Kale ba zundamina buti Jesu aba tabe. Jesu kale ga kotoka no ku ba ta nage, “Ati kwenu nkwali uju ta ga la tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju, a be gwe tanzi uku shonja ibwe kwa joju u mwanakazi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kale ga kotama kame no ku ñola ansi.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Aa se ba la shugwi bulyao, kale ba zwao genke-genke ku tatikila ku mukulu tanzi ku leka Jesu no jojo u mwanakazi na si zimeneo. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Jesu kale ga kotoka kame no ku ta jojo u mwanakazi nage, “Mwanakazi, aba ka ba ku atula kwibo ba la ji? Takuli nanga genke uju a la ku atuli?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Jojo u mwanakazi kale ga ta nage, “Takuli Mfumwangu.” Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Neme ta ndi ku atule. U jende mi no leke ka tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju kame.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu nde tuba lyelonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Jesu kale ga gamba ku bantu kame nage, “Ndime tuba lyelonga. Ati na mu ndi umpilila, ta na mu jende mu kansindwe, kakuli kuti na mu be ne tuba ili na li mi twale ku bumi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />A Bafalisi kale ba taba nabo, “Ndigwe u kwesi uku li paka gwemwini! Mi u bupaki bwa bulyao mbwa manya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Nanganceciba buti ndime ndi li paka ndemwini, u bupaki bwangu mbwa conse. Kakuli ndi li zi uku ndi zwa mi ndi li zekelele uku ndi ja, kono inwe ta mwi zi bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Inwe mwa sa ndi atula ko buntu, kono ime ta ndi atuli u muntu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Kono kame nanga na ndi atula, inkatulo jangu ji li lulikile, kakuli ta li ndenke ndi kele. Tata uju sa ndi tuma, neme a kele. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />U mulao mbuti gu co buti ati a bantu bo bile ta ba andani mu bupaki bwabo, u bupaki bwabo mbwa conse mi bwa sa tambulwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ime ndi li mpaki, mi Tata uju sa ndi tuma nage numpaki jumwinya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Kale ba buza Jesu nabo, “Isho kwibo a li?” Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ko ku sa ndi ziba buti ndimeni, no Tata ta mu goli uku mu ziba. Ka li na mu la ndi zibi, na mu la zibi no Tata bulyao.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Jesu kale ga gamba gago a majwi aa ka kwesi uku ziga mu tumpetu to tempele utu ka tu li afuwi no cibaka u mu ka ku tuligwanga a mampo. Kono takuli u muntu ka gola uku mu shumina kakuli inako jakwe ka ji sini uku sika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo nkatulo ji keza</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Jesu kame kale ga ba ta nage, “Se ndi la kaja. Mi kuti na mu ndi shake mi kuti na mu fwile mu bitendantu i bimangoju byenu. Uku ndi ja ta mu goli uku jako.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />A Majuda kale ba li buza mwalyabo nabo, “Kame a gajite uku li yaga gemwini? Ncinzi a toloka aa ta buti, ‘Ta mu goli uku ja uku ndi ja’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Jesu kale ga nungako nage, “Inwe mpasi mu zwa, ime nkwigulu ndi zwa. Inwe mu li ba le lino ilonga, ime ta ndi li gwa le lino ilonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Mpaa ndi la mi ti buti kuti na mu fwile mu bitendantu i bimangoju byenu ati ta mu zumini buti ndime, kuti na mu fwile mu bitendantu i bimangoju byenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ndigweni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Bulyaa ndi mi telanga bulyo ku zwa ku matatikilo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Mbingi ndi kwesi byo ku gamba no ku atula kebaka lyenu, kono ta na ndi tende bulyao. Kakuli nda sa lugwila bulyo a bantu belonga ibi na nda shugwa ku zwa kwoju na ga ndi tuma, mi ige ngwaconse wawa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Kono no ao na ba kangwa uku shugwilisa buti mbyesi ka ta.<verse eid="JHN 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Aa se mu la mani uku ndi angika ime nde Mwana Muntu a cifapaano, nko kuti na mu shugwilise buti ndimeni. Ta li kame ndi li tendela i bintu ndemwini kono nda sa gamba ibi na ga ndi ziga bulyo Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Uju sa ndi tuma neme a kele mi ta na ga ndi leka, kakuli inako jonse nda sa tenda ibi bi mu jangaza.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Cwale u bungi bo bantu aba na ba mu shugwa na ta bulyao, kale ba zumina kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba byo bana Nyambe ba conse</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Jesu kale ga ta a Majuda aba na ba zumina kwakwe nage, “Mu li bazigigwa bangu wawa ati na mu sepaala ku bintu ndi mi ziga. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Kuti na mu zibe initi mi initi kuti na ji mi lukulule.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Abo kale ba mu ta nabo, “Iswe tu li bo luasi lwa Abbulaama mi ta twa la ba a baika bo muntu gense. Ncinzi u toloka aa u ta buti, ‘Kuti na mu lukululwe’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila u muntu gense uju a tenda i bitendantu i bimangoju, muika go bitendantu i bimangoju. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mi u muika ngwa nako imfuwi bulyo mu luasi, kono u mwana ige muntu a kalilile mu luasi inako jonse. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ati u Mwana na mi lukulula, kuti na mu lukululwe wawa. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ee, ndi li zekelele buti mu li bo luasi lwa Abbulaama. Kono bamwinya mukati kenu kame ba shaka uku ndi yaga kakuli i bintu ndi ziga ta bi kwesi u bukalo mu myojo jabo. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Kame ndi kwesi uku mi gambaguza ibi se ndi bona aa ka ndi kele no Tata. Kono mwa sa umpilila ibi na mwa shugwa kwe Senu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Abo kale ba ta nabo, “Isetu ndi Abbulaama!” Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Ka li na mu li bana ba Abbulaama wawa na mu la umpilili u mwanza gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Kono inwe kame mu shaka uku ndi yaga, kakuli se ndi mi lugwila initi iji na nda shugwa kwa Nyambe. Abbulaama ta ga la tenda bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />I bintu mu tenda nkwesenu bi zwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Abo kale ba ta nabo, “Ta tu li bana ba mu bunyazi! Kono Nyambe ndesetu bulyo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ka li Nyambe ndesenu na mu ndi shaka, kakuli nkwa Nyambe na nda zwa no keza kwenu. Ntali ndime ndi li kalikite aano kono ndi Nyambe sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ncinzi aa ta mu shugwilisi ibi ndi gamba? Ibaka nku ta buti ta mu shugwi ibi ndi gamba. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Kakuli mu li bana Satani, mi ndesenu mi mu li bo ku shaka uku tenda u bubi ubu a tenda. Muyagi ku zwa ku matatikilo ngwa ku zimba initi, kakuli initi ta ji ku li kwakwe. Aa gamba a manya kwakwe mbobo kakuli ngo mukalilo gwakwe, kakuli ngwa manya mi ndo muzazi go manya gonse. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Mi ime aa ndi mi lugwila initi ta mu zumini kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ndini kwenu uju a gola uku ndi bonisa buti ndi li go bitendantu i bimangoju? Cwale ati ime kame ndi kwesi uku mi gambaguza i bintu byaconse, ncinzi aa ta mu zumini kwangu? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />U muntu gense uju a zwa kwa Nyambe ga sa tegeleza ku majwi ga Nyambe. Kono inwe mwa sa kangwa uku shugwa kakuli ta mu li ba Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li lugula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />A bajendesi bo Majuda kale ba mu taba nabo, “Igwe gwe Musamaliya u li kwesi u moya u mubi! Mbyaconse na twa gamba aa ka tu ta buti ndiyauma li ku munite.”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Ta ndi kwesi iyauma. Ime ndi Tata ndi kutika, kono inwe mu li bo ku ndi shwauza. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Ta ndi li lumbi ndemwini, kono Nyambe ndege a ndi lumba mi ndo muatuli gwaconse. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, u muntu gense uju a kutika ibi ndi ziga ta na fwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />A bantu kale ba ta nabo, “Aano kale twa ziba buti ndiyauma li ku munite! Abbulaama no baboni ba Nyambe se ba fwa, kono igwe kame u ta buti, ‘U muntu gense uju a kutika i bintu u ziga ta na fwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Mbuti u co buti u li munene ku ita Isetu Abbulaama? Kakuli ige sa fwa mane no baboni ba Nyambe bulyao. Igwe mbuti u li gajila buti ndigweni?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ati na ndi li lumba ndemwini, uku li lumba kwangu ta ku toloki i cintu. Uju a ndi lumba ndi Tata ige wawa, uju mu ta buti ndi Nyambe gwenu, ndege a ndi lumba. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ta mu mu zekelele, kono ime ndi li mu zekelele. Ka li na ndi la ti buti, ta ndi mu zekelele na ndi la bi go manya sinagwe ndinwe! Kono ndi li mwizi mi ndi la mu kutika. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Isenu Abbulaama ka nyangulukite aa ka lindile ijuba lyangu lyo keza. Na ga li bona mi na ga jangala.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />A bantu kale ba mu ta nabo, “U sini uku kwanisa i myaka jo makumi ga 5 cwale mbuti u gola uku ta buti so bona Abbulaama?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti Abbulaama aa ka sini uku bonigwa, ime nko ka ndi li.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Aobulyo kale ba tatika uku tola-tola a mabwe buti ba mu sobagule. Kono Jesu kale ga li bika ko ku leguka ku anina kunze jo tempele.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi uju na ga bonigwa na li muofu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Jesu aa ka jenda bulyao, kale ga bona unkosi uju ka li muofu ku zwa aa na ga bonenwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />A bazigigwa kale ba mu buza nabo, “Muzigi, ncinzi joju unkosi aa na ga bonigwa na li muofu? Izo nkebaka lyo bitendantu byakwe i bimangoju, kampa mbitendantu i bimangoju byo bazazi bakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ntali mbitendantu i bimangoju byakwe kampa byo bazazi bakwe. Ibaka ndya ku ta buti na kwa tendaala bulyao buti inguzu ja Nyambe ji bonaale kebaka lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tu li botele uku tenda wangu i misebezi jo muntu uju na ga tu tuma. A masiku ga la keza mi takuli uju na gole uku sebeza. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Aano ndi si kele mwilonga, ndime tuba lyelonga.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Bebyo aa se bi la mani, Jesu kale ga suwila ansi mi kale ga gwanika ivu no mate ku tenda itapa, mi kale ga lamba lelyo itapa a mensho ga jojo unkosi u muofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Jesu kale ga lugwila jojo unkosi nage, “U jende u ka shambe mu kaziba ka Silowe.” (Silowe nku toloka buti “Kutumwa”). Jojo unkosi kale ga ka ja no ka shamba mi kale ga ka bogola ku munzi buwene.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus heals man born blind" file="dn00456b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 9:1-7" copy="Dunham" ref="9:1-7">Jesu aa oza unkosi na ga bonigwa na li muofu</figure><verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Aba ka sumpite nabo afuwi na ba ka ba mu zekelele buti muofu mi ka li nkumbizi, kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Uju unkosi ta li ndege ka kalanga na kumbila?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Ndege.” Kono bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Inga, mbulyo a mu kozete!” Kono jojo unkosi kale ga zundamina uku ba ta nage, “Ee, ndime wawa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />A bantu kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ndini na ga oza a mensho gako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Kale ga ba taba nage, “Nu nkosi uju ba kuga buti ndi Jesu ndege na ga tenda itapa no ku li ndi lamba a mensho. Kale ga ndi ta buti ndi ka shambe mu kaziba ka Silowe. Kale nda ka ja no ka shamba mi mbobo na nda bonena.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Kale ba mu buza nabo, “Uku a li aano kwibo?” Kale ga ba taba nage, “Mbwita.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Bafalisi aa ba buzagula jojo unkosi u muofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />A bantu kale ba inda jojo unkosi uju ka li muofu no ku mu twala ku Bafalisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kakuli Jesu na ga tenda itapa no ku lamba jojo unkosi a mensho no ku mu oza mwijuba lyo Nsabata. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />A Bafalisi kale ba buza jojo unkosi a jejo intaba no bu na ga bonena. Ige kale ga ba ta nage, “Ndi tapa na ga ndi lamba a mensho, kale nda li shamba mi ku zwao kale nda bona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />A Bafalisi bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Joju unkosi a kugigwa Jesu ta li nkwa Nyambe a zwa kakuli ga sa sebeza lyo Nsabata.” Bamwinya kame kale ba ta nabo, “U muntu go bitendantu i bimangoju mbuti na gola uku tendela i bijuliko ibi bi makaza bulyaa?” Ko ku tenda bulyao, kale ba yayana mu migajalo jabo. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />A Bafalisi kale ba buza kame jojo unkosi uju ka li muofu nabo, “Igwe mbuti u mu gajila jojo unkosi na ga oza a mensho gako?” Jojo unkosi kale ga ba taba nage, “Muboni gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />A bajendesi bo Majuda ka ba si kana uku zumina buti jojo unkosi ka li muofu no ku ta buti sa la bona kame mbwita aa na ba kuga a bazazi bakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Kale ba ba buza nabo, “Ndi mwanenu joju? Sa bonigwa na li muofu? Ati mbobo ku kalile, mbuti aa sa bona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />A bazazi bakwe kale ba taba nabo, “Tu li zi buti joju ndi mwanetu mi sa bonigwa na li muofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Kono ta tu zekelele ici ci leta buti a bone kampa ndini a la mu ozi. Mu mu li buzagwile, mukulu a la gola uku li gambila gemwini.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />A bazazi bakwe kale ba gamba bulyao kebaka lyo ku joga a Majuda, aba se ba kugiliza buti u muntu gense uju na te buti Jesu Mushaligwa gwa Nyambe, ka botele uku tandilwa kunze jo njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Mpaa ka ba ta nabo, “Mukulu, mu mu buze.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />A Bafalisi kale ba kuga jojo unkosi uju ka li muofu lyabili, mi kale ba mu ta nabo, “U lumbe Nyambe a jeji intaba kakuli tu li zi buti Jesu ngwa bitendantu i bimangoju.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Jojo unkosi ka li muofu kale ga ba ta nage, “Ta ndi zi indi jojo unkosi mutendi go bitendantu i bimangoju i cintu conke ndi zi nku ta buti, ka ndi li muofu kono aano se ndi la bona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Kale ba mu buza kame nabo, “Mbuti na ga tendela? Mbuti na ga ozekeza a mensho gako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ige kale ga taba nage, “Ndi la mi gambaguzi kale kono ta mu shugwi. Ncinzi mu shaka uku shugwa kame? Mwa sa shaka uku ba a bazigigwa bakwe nenwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />A Bafalisi kale ba mu nyungulula nabo, “Ndigwe muzigigwa gwakwe! Iswe tu li bazigigwa ba Mushe. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Tu li zi buti Nyambe nkwa Mushe sa gamba kono ta tu zekelele uku a zwa joju unkosi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Jojo unkosi u muofu kale ga ba taba nage, “Nce cintu ci komokwisa ceco, nenwe ta mu zekelele uku a zwa kono na ga oza a mensho gangu. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tu li zekelele buti Nyambe ta tegelezi a bantu bo bitendantu i bimangoju, kono ga sa tegeleza a bantu aba ba mu lapela no ku tenda ubu a shakila. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ku zwa aa na lya bumbilwa ilonga, takuli uju sa tondesa a mensho go muntu sa bonigwa na li muofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ka li joju unkosi ta li nkwa Nyambe na zwa, ta na la tendi cimwinya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />A Bafalisi kale ba mu taba nabo, “Igwe na gwa bonigwa no li muntu go bitendantu i bimangoju wawa, kame u shaka uku tu ziga?” Aobulyo kale ba mu tandila kunze jo cibaka co malapelelo co Majuda.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ziga byo buofu bo Moya</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Jesu aa sa la shugwi buti a Bafalisi na ba mu tandila kunze, kale ga gwana jojo unkosi ka li muofu mi kale ga mu buza nage, “U la zumina kwa Mwana Muntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Jojo unkosi kale ga taba nage, “U kwali nkwibo, mfumwangu, buti ndi zumine kwakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U la mu boni mi ndege jo juno a gambagula negwe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Jojo unkosi kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwangu, ndi la zumina,” mi kale ga lapela Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ibi na nda kezela mo muno mwilonga ni nkatulo buti a baofu ba bone mi aba ba bona ba be a baofu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />A Bafalisi bamwinya aba ka ba zimene afuwi kale ba shugwa Jesu na gamba bulyao, mi kale ba mu buza nabo, “Mbuti u co, buti tu li baofu neswe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Ka li na mu li baofu ta na mu kwesi u mulandu go bitendantu i bimangoju, kono kakuli kame mu ta buti mu la bona, u mulandu gwenu gu li kalilile.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu nde mulisani u mulotu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, u muntu uju a shotokela mu mulaka gongu uku ta itili mu cizi, musa mi kame ncijoni! <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Kono uju a nginina mu cizi nde mulisani gongu. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />U mulindi uju a zimananga a cizi ga sa galwila u mulisani ku cizi mi ingu se ji la ziba ijwi lyakwe mi se ji la ana. U mulisani sa la ji kuga ko mazina gajo mi sa la ji tangilila. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Aa sa la ji gwaniki jonse, sa la ji tangilila mi se ji la mu umpilila kakuli ji li zekelele ijwi lyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Kono ingu ta na ji umpilile unyenda mane kuti na ji mu tige kakuli ta ji zekelele ijwi lyakwe.”<figure style="fig" alt="Sheep fold and shepherds" file="lb00014b.jpg" size="span" loc="Jhn 10:1-5" copy="Knowles" ref="10:1-5">Ndime cizi congu</figure><verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Jesu kale ga litusisa gogu u mwanza kono a Bafalisi ta na ba shugwilisa ici ka toloka. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Mi kame Jesu kale ga ba tansulwila nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, ndime cizi congu. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />A bantu bonse aba na ba keza ime na ndi sini uku keza, mbasa mi mbijoni. Kono ingu ta na ja ba tegeleza. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ee, ndime cizi. A bantu bonse aba na ba ngine ko ku litusisa ime kuti na ba jojeswe. Kuti na ba ngine no ku ana mi kuti na ba joje bu liketete sinagwe ningu ji la gwani u buyango. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />U musa mbulyo a kezanga ku ku iba no ku yaga no ku jona. Kono ime na nda keza buti ndi we u bumi ku bantu bangu mi ba bu gwane mu bungi.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Ime ndime mulisani u mulotu. U mulisani u mulotu ga sa wa u bumi bwakwe ku ba i citagilo kwingu jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />U mubeleki bulyo uju ta li u mulisani mi ta li ndo mwini ingu aa bona umbogela a keza sa la leka ingu no ku tiga. Ga sa leka ingu no ku tiga kakuli ta li ndo mulisani gwajo. Mi ko ku tenda bulyao umbogela sa la zoganisa ingu no ku ji mwaga-mwaga. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />U mubeleki ga sa tiga kakuli nku masheleñi bulyo a twalikize ingana ta babaleli ingu.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />“Ndime mulisani u mulotu, ndi li zi ingu jangu mi najo ji li ndi zi. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Sinagwe ndi Tata ubu a ndi zibile mi neme ndi li zi Tata. Neme bulyao nda sa wa u bumi bwangu ku ba i citagilo kwingu. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ndi li kwesi ingu jimwinya iji ta ji li ja gogu u mulaka. Najo ndi li botele u ka ji inda bulyao. Mi najo kuti na ji shugwe ijwi lyangu, mi kuti na ji be ingu jo mugona gonke no mulisani genke.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Tata a la ndi shaka kakuli nda sa wa u bumi bwangu ku ba i citagilo buti na ndi bu gwane kame. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Takuli uju a gola uku ndi tapa u bumi bwangu kono nda sa bu wa ko bu ndi shakila. Ndi li kwesi inguzu jo ku bu tagila no jo ku bu bogoza kame, kakuli mbobo sa ndi lagila Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Jesu aa sa la gambi bulyao, a Majuda kale ba andana ubu ka ba mu gajila. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Ndiyauma li mu munite, mi sa la pakumuka. Ncinzi co ku tegeleza ku muntu gwa bulyao?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Gaga a majwi ta ga botele uku zwa ku muntu a munitwe kwiyauma! Kakuli iyauma ta li goli uku tondisa a mensho go muofu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Se ka gu li mweo mi Jesu mwa Jelusalema ka li ku mukiti go ku cenesa i tempele. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Mi Jesu mu tumpetu to tempele ka li na jenda-jenda mu malibela ga Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />A Majuda aba ka ba gwanene momo kale ba mu zimbuluka mi kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ndi kalusiku no tu gwise i myojo? Ati ndigwe Mushaligwa u tu lugwile nenja.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Na nda mi lugwila kale, kono ta mu zumini kwangu. I misebezi ndi tenda mwizina lya Tata njejo ji ndi paka. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Kono ta mu zumini kwangu kebaka lyo ku ta buti ta li mu li ingu jangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ingu jangu ji la ku tegelezanga ijwi lyangu. Ndi li ji zi mi ja sa ndi umpilila. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nda sa ji wa u bumi ta bu mani mi ta na ji fwe. Takuli u muntu a gola uku ji ndi tapa, <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />kakuli Tata uju na ga ji ndi wa ngwa nguzu ku ita a bantu bonse. Takuli uju a gola uku ji zwisa mwiganja lya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Ime no Tata tu li muntu genge.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />A Majuda aba ka ba mu lwisa kale ba tola a mabwe kame buti ba mu sobagule. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Na nda mi bonisa i misebezi i mingi i milotu ku ja ko bu sa ndi lagila Tata. Kwa jejo i misebezi, musebezi gwa buti mu shaka uku ndi sobagwila ko mabwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />A Majuda kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ta li musebezi u mulotu tu shaka ku ku sobagwila kono ndibaka lyo kashwau! Igwe u li muntu u mushwauki bulyo kono gwa sa li ta buti ndigwe Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Mu mulao gwenu mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, ‘Na nda ta buti, mu li mizimu.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Nimbo 82:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Mi mu li zi buti a Mañolo ta ga goli uku maniswa. Cwale ati Nyambe na ga kuga a bantu aba sa wa ijwi lyakwe buti mizimu, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />ingeme, na nda shaligwa kwa Nyambe Tata no ku ndi tuma mwilonga, ncinzi aa mu ta buti ndi Nyambe ndi shwauza aa ndi la ti buti, ‘Ndi li Mwana Nyambe’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Mu leke uku zumina kwangu ati ta li musebezi gwa Tata ndi tenda. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Kono ati musebezi gwakwe ndi tenda, mu zumine ku mamakazo no misebezi iji na nda tenda, nanganceciba buti ta mu zumini kwangu, mu zibe no ku shugwilisa buti, Tata nkwangu a li, mi neme nkwa Tata ndi li.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />No ao kale ba jeleka buti ba mu shumine kono Jesu kale ga zwao na ka li jila ku zwa kwabo. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Kale ga ja mwisilya lyo Lwizi lwa Joodani afuwi no cibaka uku ka kolobelezanga a bantu Joani mu majuba ga ku kale mi kale ga ka kalako. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Mi u bungi bo bantu kale ba mu umpililako. Kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Joani u mukolobezi ta ga la tenda i bijuliko ibi bi makaza kono i bintu byonse ibi ka gambanga bya joju unkosi mbyaconse.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />U bungi bo bantu aba ka ba li ao, kale ba zumina kwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lazalo aa lwala no ku fwa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ku zwao, unkosi ka kugigwa Lazalo ka li mulwele. Ka li gwa mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya u mu ka joja no bancii jakwe ba Maliya no Maleta. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliya joju, ndege sa sintila a mafuta ga tula ku matende go Mfumu Jesu no ku ga singula ko nshuki jakwe. Mi Lazalo uju ka lwala ka li ncii jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Babo bancii ja Lazalo kale ba tuma u muntu kwa Jesu ka mu ta buti, “Mfumu, musele gwako uju shaka mulwele wawa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Kono Jesu aa sa la shugwi jejo indagano, kale ga ta nage, “Bobo u bulwele bwa Lazalo ta li mbwa ku mu yaga. Inga, mbwa ku ta buti Nyambe a lumbigwe no ku ta buti ime nde Mwana Nyambe ndi lumbigwe kabo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Jesu ka shaka Maleta no mwancegwe Maliya no Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />No ku na ga shugwa buti Lazalo mulwele, kale ga kala kame a majuba go bile momo mu cibaka ka li. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Mi kale ga ta a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Ndokweni tu bogole kwilonga lya Judeya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba kana mi kale ba ta nabo, “Muzigi, majuba mace bulyo se ga itite ku zwa aa ka ba shaka ku ku sobagula ko mabwe a bantu belonga lya Judeya, kame nkoko u shaka uku ja?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ijuba mukatumbi li li kwesi a manako ge kumi no go bile, mi a kamwi, u muntu a la gola uku li jenda-jendela bu liketete kakuli a liwene ituba lyejuba. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kono a masiku u muntu a la gola uku sitagala kakuli ta kwesi ituba.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Kale ga ta kame nage, “Musele gwetu Lazalo sa li lele kono kame ndi jako ndi ka mu buse.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba ta nabo, “Mfumwetu, ati Lazalo mbulyo a lele, kuti na li shugwe nenja.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Kame ka ba gaja buti nku lala na sukula ku ja a ñonzi ka gamba, kono Jesu mbya ku fwa kwa Lazalo ka gamba.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Jesu kale ga ba gambaguza nenja nage, “Lazalo na ga fwa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />mi kebaka lyenu ndi li jangele kakuli ta ka ndi kuli buti mu zumine wawa. Kono ndokweni tu ka mu bone.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi uju ka kugigwa Didima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mushobo go Cigelike Didima ja sa toloka go “majovu”.</char></note> kale ga ta a bazigigwa bamwinya nage, “Ndokweni tu ka fwe nage antu-onke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa senga-senga ba Maleta no Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Jesu aa ka sika mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya, kale ba mu gambaguza nabo se majuba gone Lazalo na li mwibita. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ku zwa mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya ku ja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, ka lu li lujendo u lufuwi bulyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbule ka bu sika a makilomita go tatwe.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />U bungi bo Majuda ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema na ba keza ku lufu lwa Lazalo keza ku senga-senga ba Maleta no Maliya. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Maleta aa shugwa buti Jesu nkeza-keza, kale ga mu cengamina kono Maliya mu njugo ka kele. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maleta kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Mfumwangu, ka li no le ku liko, ncii jangu ta na la fwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Kono ndi li zi nanga mpaano buti Nyambe kuti a ku we i bintu byonse ibi so ko kumbile.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ncii jako kuti na buke kame.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maleta kale ga ta nage, “Ee, ndi li zi buti kuti na buke mu nako jo mbuko jo bafu mwijuba lyo mamaninino.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Jesu kale ga mu lugwila nage, “Ndime mbuko no bumi. U muntu gense uju a zumina kwangu, kuti na joje nanga na la fwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />U muntu gense uju a joja mi na zumina kwangu ta na fwe. Maleta, buti u la zumina bulyao?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Maleta kale ga mu ta nage, “Ee, Mfumwangu, ndi la zumina buti ndigwe Mushaligwa no Mwana Nyambe uju ka botele uku keza mwilonga.” <verse eid="JHN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga bogola no ka kugila mwancegwe Maliya kumbali no ka mu ta buti, “U Muzigi a la siki mi ndigwe a shaka uku bona.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Maliya aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga zimana wangu ku welangila kwa Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Jesu ka sini ku ngininina mu munzi mi ka sili a cibaka aa na ba li gwanina no Maleta. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />A Majuda aba ka ba kele no Maliya mu njugo na ba mu senga-senga, aa ba bona ubu na ga nanukila wangu ku ja anze, kale ba mu umpilila na ba gaja buti bunga nkwibita a ja buti a ka lilileko. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maliya aa ka sika aa ka li Jesu no ku mu bona, kale ga gwila ku matende ga Jesu no ku ta nage, “Mfumwangu, ka li no le ku liko, ncii jangu ta na la fwi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Jesu aa bona Maliya na lila, mane no bantu bonse aba na ba mu umpilila na ba lila nabo, Jesu kale ga shugwa uku shisha ku mojo mi kale ga tompa lwini. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Jesu kale ga ba buza nage, “Kwibo na mwa mu tula?” Kale ba mu taba nabo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">“Mfumwetu, ndokweni u ka boneko.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Jesu kale ga lila.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />A bantu kale ba ta nabo, “Nga mu lole, ubu ka mu shakila!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Bamwinya kale ba ta nabo, “Izo u muntu na ga galula a mensho go nkosi ka li muofu, buti ta na la leti buti Lazalo a leke ku fwa?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa busa Lazalo ku mu zwisa ku bafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Jesu no ao kale ga sisumuka u mubili kame mi kale ga senena kwibita. Ibita ka lili lambo na ba conkomona mwibwe mi se ba galumwina ibwe a manginino. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu zwiseko lelyo ibwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Maleta, ncii jo mufu Lazalo, kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwangu, sa la nunka u bubi kakuli se majuba gone sa inditemo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ta ndi la ku lugwili buti ati no zumina ko bona u bunene bo nguzu ja Nyambe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kale ba galumuna ibwe ku li zwisao. Jesu kale ga ligamina kwigulu no ku ta nage, “Tata, nda sa litumela kwako kakuli u la ndi shugwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ndi li zekelele buti u la ku ndi shugwanga inako jonse, kono nda sa ta bulyao kebaka lyo bantu aba ba zimene aano, buti ba zumine buti ndigwe so ndi tuma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gamba bulyao, kale ga kuga ku gongoza lwini nage, “Lazalo, zwa momo!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />U mufu kale ga zwamo, a maganja gakwe no matende na ga zingitwe a masila, limwinya isila na li zingitwe ku mensho gakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu mu zingulule gago a masila mi mu mu leke a jende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Majuda aa ba gaja uku yaga Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Male 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />U bungi bo Majuda aba na ba keza ku bona Maliya, mi na ba bona ibi na ga tenda Jesu, kale ba zumina kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Kono bamwinya kale ba ja ku Bafalisi no ka ba gambaguza i bintu ibi na ga tenda Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no Bafalisi kale ba kuga inkongani jo bakulu bo nkuta mi kale ba ta nabo, “Mbuti tu botele uku tendela? Kakuli joju u muntu ga sa tenda i bijuliko i bingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ati na tu mu lekelela na li twala-twala bulyao, a bantu bonse kuti na ba zumine kwakwe mi a Maloma kuti na ba keze ku jona-jona i tempele mane no bantu betu bonse.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Jumwinya gwabo uju ka li mupulisiti u mukulu mwa gogo u mwaka uju ka kugigwa Kayafa, kale ga ba ta nage, “Takuli ici mwizi wawa! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ta mu nanguli buti i cilotu kwenu nku ta buti u muntu genke a fwile a bantu a bangi ku ita buti a bantu belonga lyonse ba fwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayafa ta li mbulyo ka li gambila kono kebaka lyo ku ta buti ndege ka li mupulisiti u mukulu mwa gogo u mwaka, kame ka ganuna ko buboni buti Jesu ndege a botele uku fwila ilonga lyo Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Mi ta li nku fwila bulyo le lino ilonga kono buti no bantu ba Nyambe bonse aba ba mwagele, aba lete no ku ba gwanika antu-onke.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ku zwao kale ba tatika uku gaja bo ku yagila Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kebaka lelyo, Jesu kale ga zwa kwi jenda-jenda mwilonga lyo Majuda a bantu na ba mu wene. Kale ga ja bulyo ku munzi gwa Efulaimi ugu ka gu li afuwi no mangusu. Jesu kale ga ka kalako no bazigigwa bakwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Inako jo Mukiti go Majuda go Mpaseka aa se ka gu kokelele, u bungi bo bantu kale ba kambamina ku munzi gwa Jelusalema buti ba ka li cenese tanzi ijuba lyo mukiti na li sini ku sika. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Kale ba zundamina uku shaka Jesu, mi aa ka ba zimene mu tumpetu to tempele ka ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Mbuti mu gajila? Izo Jesu ta keze ku mukiti wawa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Kono a mapulisiti a bakulu no Bafalisi se ba ta buti u muntu gense uju na bone Jesu, na keze ku lugula buti na ba mu kwate.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliya aa singa Jesu a mafuta ku matende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Male 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Aa se ka ku sigalile a majuba ga 6 buti u mukiti go Mpaseka gu tendaale, Jesu kale ga sika mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya mu munzi gwa Lazalo uju sa busigwa kwa Jesu ku mu zwisa ku bafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Kale ba kutika Jesu ko ku mu tendela i bilyo. Maleta ndege ka taa, mi Lazalo ka li jumwinya go bantu aba ka ba lya no Jesu a ntafule. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mi Maliya kale ga inda ibotela u mu kakuli a mafuta a mangi ga nunka u bulotu, aga ga tula lwini no ku nunka nenja. Mi kale ga ga sintila ku matende ga Jesu no ku ga singula ko nshuki jakwe. Injugo jonse kale ja lasauka u mununko u mulotu go mafuta.<figure style="fig" alt="Mary anoints Jesus' feet" file="cn01778b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 12:1-3" ref="12:1-3">Maliya aa singa a matende ga Jesu a mafuta</figure><verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Kono Judasi Isikaliota, jumwinya go bazigigwa ba Jesu uju ka botele uku mu legeza, kale ga kana mi kale ga ta nage, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ncinzi aa ta na ga gulisigwa gaga a mafuta no ku wa a masheleñi ku bampale? Ka ga gola uku gulisigwa a masheleñi aga a gola uku belekela u muntu a mwaka mukatumbi.” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Judasi aa ka ta bulyao ta li nku ta buti kame ka babalela a bampale kono ka li musa, mi ko ku ba buti ndege ka li mubiki go mukotana go masheleñi, ka ibangao ku li tusa gemwini.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Mu mu leke bulyao genke kakuli ici ka bikile gaga a mafuta ndi juba lyo ku zikigwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />A bampale kuti mu kalange nabo inako jonse kono ime ta na mu kale neme inako jonse.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Mwa jejo inako a bantu a bangi bo Majuda kale ba ziba buti Jesu mo ka li mu munzi gwa Bbetaniya. Kale ba kezamo mi ta li ndi Jesu bulyo ka ba shaka uku bona kono kame ka ba shaka uku bona no Lazalo uju sa busigwa kwa Jesu ku bafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Mi a mapulisiti a bakulu kale ba zumininana buti ba yage no Lazalo bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Kebaka lya Lazalo u bungi bo Majuda se ka ba keza kwa Jesu no ku zumina kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ngina mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Male 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ijuba na lya nungako, u bungi bo bantu aba na ba keza ku Mukiti go Mpaseka kale ba shugwa buti Jesu mu munzi gwa Jelusalema a keza. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Kale ba inda intabi jo malali mi kale ba mu cengamina. Kale ba tatika uku kumba nabo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Nyambe a lumbigwe!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Imfwijaguzi njakwe uju a keza mwizina lyo Mfumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Imfwijaguzi nja Mfumu gwelonga lya Isilaele!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Nimbo 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:15">Zefaniya 3:15</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Jesu kale ga gwana a kambongolo-gana mi kale ga paamao ubu ku ñolelwe buti,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mu leke uku joga mwe bantu ba mu munzi gwa Jelusalema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Nga mu lole! Ujo nde mfumwenu a keza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">mi kame a paamite a kambongolo-gana.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakaliya 9:9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Etanzi, a bazigigwa ba Jesu ta na ba shugwilisa gogo u mugambilo. Jesu aa sa la kutikigwa ko ku lumbigwa bulyao, kale ba vuluka buti byebyo i bintu na bya ñoligwa mi na bya tendaala kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />A bantu a bangi aba na ba bona Jesu na busa Lazalo ku mu zwisa mwibita mu cibaka co bantu bo ku fwa, kale ba zundamina uku gambaguza bamwinya ijwi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />A bantu a bangi aa se ba la shugwi buti Jesu sa tenda ceco i cijuliko ici ci makaza, kale ba mu cengamina. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Mi a Bafalisi kale ba li gambaguza mwalyabo nabo, “Nga mu lole, takuli ici tu gola uku tenda. Mu lole a bantu belonga lyonse se ba li mu umpilile!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ganuna byo lufu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Mukati ko bantu aba na ba ja ku Mukiti go Mpaseka mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, mo ka ba li no Magelike bamwinya aba na ba keza ku ku lapela. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Kale ba kezela Filipi gwa mu munzi gwa Bbesaida gwa mwilonga lya Galileya no ku mu ta nabo, “Tata, kame tu shaka uku bona Jesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipi kale ga gambaguza Andileya, mi u bubili bwabo kale ba ka gambaguza Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Jesu kale ga ta nage, “I nako jangu ji la siki ime nde Mwana Muntu buti ndi wegwe impazimo. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, ati u lweke lo mundale ta lu gwili ansi no ku fwa, kuti na lu sigale na lu li lweke lonke bulyao. Kono ati na lu fwa, lwa sa aka no ku leta u bweke u bungi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />U muntu gense uju a shaka lwini u bumi bwakwe, kuti na bu jonekelwe, kono uju a zimba u bumi bwakwe mwa le lino ilonga, ndege na bu bike mi kuti na gwane u bumi ta bu mani. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />U muntu aa ndi sebeleza a li botele uku ndi umpilila, mi uku ndi kele no muika gwangu nkoko na ka kale. Mi Tata kuti na kutike u muntu a ndi sebeleza.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“U mojo gwangu se mu nkalilwa se gu li mi ncinzi sa ka ndi te? Ndi te buti, ‘Tata, u ndi lamwine, kwa je jino inako jo mapenzi’? Inga, ndebaka na nda kezela buti ndi sike mo muno mu nako jo mapenzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata, u leke izina lyako li lumbigwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Aobulyo, kale kwa shugwaala ijwi li gamba mwigulu na lyo, “Nkale na nda leta buti li lumbigwe mi kuti na ndi lete buti li lumbigwe kame.” <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />A bantu a bangi aba ka ba lio, kale ba shugwa lelyo ijwi mi kale ba ta nabo, “Umvula a la lengi!” Bamwinya nabo, “Ni ñiloi li la gambi kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Kono Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Leli ijwi ta li nkwangu lila kezi kono nkwenu buti mu gwane intuso. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Je jino se ni nako jo nkatulo ja le lino ilonga mi u mfumu gwa le lino ilonga kuti na tandilwe kunze. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Mi ime aa se ndi la angikigwa mwigulu ku zwa ansi, kuti na ndi kokele a bantu bonse kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Jesu kale ga gamba bulyao ku sunda u mukalilo go lufu ulu na fwe kalo.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />A bantu a bangi kale ba ta nabo, “Se tu shugwa mu mulao buti u Mushaligwa ta na fwe, cwale igwe mbuti u gola uku ta buti, ‘Mwana Muntu kuti na fwe’? Uju ‘Mwana Muntu’ ndini?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Kuti na mu be ne tuba mu nako imfuwi bulyo. Mu jende ituba aa li si kele, a kansindwe na ka sini ku mi vwika. Kakuli u muntu a jenda mu kansindwe ta zekelele uku a tungulwize. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Mu zumine kwituba, aa li si kele nenwe buti mu be a bana be tuba.” Jesu aa sa la mani uku gamba bulyao, kale ga zwa momo no ka li bika buti ba leke ku mu bona.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku sa zumina ko Majuda</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Jesu no ku na ga tenda i bijuliko ibi bi makaza i bingi na ba mu lolelele, a bantu ka ba si kangwa uku zumina kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Kale kwa tendaala bulyao ku vumbiliza ijwi lyo muboni gwa Nyambe Isaya aa sa ta buti,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mfumwangu, ndini na ga zumina ibi ka tu gamba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Nku bani uku na ga sunda Nyambe inguzu jakwe jo Bumfumu?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isaya 53:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ka lelyo ibaka, a bantu se ba kangwa uku zumina kakuli Isaya sa ta kame buti,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nyambe na ga zima a mensho gabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">mi na ga kukutuwisa i myojo jabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">buti ba leke uku bona ko mensho gabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">mi ta ba shugwilisi ko myojo jabo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">buti ba leke uku sigulukila kwangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">mi ka ndi ba oza.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isaya 6:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya sa ta bulyao kakuli sa bona impazimo ja Jesu mi kale ga gamba byakwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Nanganceciba bulyao, u bungi bo bantu mane no bajendesi bamwinya, kale ba zumina kwakwe. Kono kebaka lyo Bafalisi kale ba joga uku li bonaaza buti ba li zumine kwa Jesu buti mane ba tandigwe mu njugo jo malapelelo jo Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kakuli kame ka ba shaka uku lumbigwa ku bantu ku ita uku lumbigwa kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Jesu kale ga kugiliza nage, “U muntu gense ati na zumina kwangu, ta li nkwangu bulyo a zumina, kono ga sa zumina no kwa joju na ga ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Kakuli uju a ndi bona, a la boni noju na ga ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ime na nda keza mwilonga buti ndi be sinagwe ndituba, buti u muntu gense uju a zumina kwangu, a leke ku kala mu kansindwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />“Mi ati u muntu gense na shugwa a majwi gangu kono ta tendi ubu ga co, ime ta ndi mu atuli. Kakuli ta na nda kezela uku atula a bantu ba mwilonga, kono kame na nda keza ku ba jojesa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />U muntu uju a ndi kana no ku sa tambula a majwi gangu, nkwali u muatuli uju na mu atule. A majwi aga na nda gamba, ngago na ga mu atule mwijuba lyo mamaninino. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Kakuli ta li mbulyo ka ndi li gambila ubu ka ndi shakila, kono Tata uju na ga ndi tuma ndege na ga ndi laga ibi ka ndi botele uku gamba no bo ku bi gambila. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mi ndi li zi buti i bintu sa laga mbebyo bi leta u bumi ta bu mani. Ibi ndi gamba byonse mbebyo sa ndi lugwila Tata buti ndi bi gambe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa sanza a matende go bazigigwa bakwe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Se ka ku sigalile bulyo ijuba lyonke buti u Mukiti go Mpaseka gu tendaale. Jesu uju kezi buti inako jakwe ji la siki jo ku leka ilonga no ku ja kwesi, ko ku shaka a bantu bakwe aba ka ba li mwilonga, kale ga ba shaka lwini ku twala ku mamaninino. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Aa ka ba kwesi uku lya u mulalilo, Satani se ka nginikite u mugajalo kwa Judasi, mwana Simoni Isikaliota, buti a legeze Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Jesu uju ka zekelele buti Nyambe Tata na ga mu wa inguzu egulu lyo bintu byonse, no ku ta buti nkwa Nyambe sa zwa mi se ka bogola kwa Nyambe, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />kale ga nanuka ku zwa aa ka ba lila i bilyo, kale ga jabula i cijabalo cakwe no ku li lepula intaulo mu munda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Aa sa la tendi bulyao, kale ga sintila a menzi mu kasuba no ku tatika uku sanza a matende go bazigigwa bakwe. Kale ga ga jumisa ko ntaulo iji ka li lepwile.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Jesu kale ga keza kwa Simoni Pitolosi, ige kale ga mu ta nage, “Mfumwangu, to botele uku sanza a matende gangu igwe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “To shugwilisi ibi ndi tenda aano kono kwa ja-majuba kuti no bi shugwilise.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Pitolosi kale ga ta nage, “Inga, to no sanze a matende gangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ati ta ndi ku sanzi ku matende, to si li gwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga mu taba nage, “Mfumwangu, u leke ku ndi sanza bulyo ku matende kono u ndi sanze ku mutwi no ku maganja!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U muntu uju a la shambi, mi sa li cenete u mubili gonse, ta si botele uku shamba kame mbwita ku matende bulyo. Nenwe se mu li cenete kono ta li ndinwe mwense mu cenete.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Kakuli Jesu kezi uju na mu legeze mpaa ka ta buti, “Mu li cenete kono ta li ndinwe mwense mu cenete.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku sanza a matende go bazigigwa bakwe, kale ga jabala i cijabalo cakwe, mi kale ga kala ansi. Kale ga buza a bazigigwa bakwe nage, “Izo mu la shugwilisi ibi ndi la mi gambaguzi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwa sa ndi kuga buti ‘Muzigi’ no ‘Mfumu’ mi ndiconse, kakuli Ndime. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ati ime nde Mfumwenu no Muzigi, ndi la mi sanzi ku matende, nenwe bulyao mu li botele uku li sanzanga ku matende. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ndi la mi sundi u mwanza buti nenwe mu tendange ubu ndi la tendeli. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti takuli u muika a ita mfumwe mi takuli u mutumigwa a ita uju a la mu tumi. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Aano se mwizi byebi i bintu, Nyambe kuti na mi we imfwijaguzi ati na mu bi tenda.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa gamba buti kuti na legezigwe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Ntali ndinwe mwense ndi ta, ndi li zi aba na nda shala. Kono byebi bya sa vumbiliza a Mañolo aga ga ta buti, ‘U muntu uju a lya i bilyo neme, a la ndi zokeli.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Nimbo 41:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nda sa mi lugwililila icimo na bi sini uku tendaala byebi i bintu, buti aa na bi tendaale na mu zumine buti Ime Ndime. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, u muntu gense uju a tambula u muntu uju ndi la tumi, ndime a la tambuli. Mi u muntu gense uju a ndi tambula, a la tambuli noju na ga ndi tuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gamba bulyao, kale ga li kalililwa mu moya gwakwe mi kale ga gamba ku ba tulwila nage, “Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, jumwinya gwenu kuti na ndi legeze.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba li lola mwalyabo, na ba kangwite uku ziba uju ka ta Jesu mukati kabo. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Jumwinya go bazigigwa uju ka shakigwa lwini kwa Jesu, ka sendamite ambali no Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga labiza jojo u muzigigwa no ku mu ta nage, “Ngo mu buze buti ndini a ta.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Jojo u muzigigwa kale ga zendamina Jesu, mi kale ga mu buza nage, “Mfumwetu, ndini u ta?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Uju sa ka ndi we i cinkwa ici sa ka ndi sunse, ndege jojo.” Kale ga inda i cinkwa no ku ci sunsa mu kasuba mi kale ga ci wa Judasi Isikaliota, mwana Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Judasi aa sa la indi i cinkwa, Satani kale ga ngina kwakwe. Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ici u tenda u ci tende wangu!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ku bantu aba ka ba lya, takuli uju na ga shugwilisa buti ncinzi Jesu aa ka mu ta bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Judasi ko ku ba uju ka bikanga a masheleñi, a bazigigwa bamwinya kame ka ba gaja buti Jesu kame ka mu ta buti a ka gule ibi ka bi shakaala a mukiti kampa uku wa cimwinya ku bampale. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Judasi aa sa la tambuli i cinkwa, aobulyo kale ga anina anze mi se ka ku li masiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ganuna buti Pitolosi kuti na mu shampule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Male 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Judasi aa sa la ka ji, Jesu kale ga ta nage, “Aano cwale ime nde Mwana Muntu se ndi la lumbigwa mi no Nyambe sa la lumbigwa kebaka lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Mi ati Nyambe na lumbigwa kebaka lyangu, Nyambe kuti na we a malumbo kwangu wangu-wangu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Banangu, ta ndi si kwesi inako inde bu kele nenwe. Kuti na mu ndi shake kono ta na mu gole uku ja uku ndi ja. Mbobo se ndi tela no bajendesi bo Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nda sa mi wa u mulao u muya, ‘Mu li shake.’ Sinagwe ubu na nda mi shakila nenwe mu li shake bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ko ku tenda bulyao a bantu bonse kuti na ba zibe buti mu li bazigigwa bangu aa mu li shaka mwalyenu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga buza Jesu nage, “Mfumwangu, uku ja nkwibo?” Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Uku ndi ja, to goli uku ndi umpililako aano, kono kwa ja-majuba kuti no ndi umpilile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Pitolosi kale ga mu buza nage, “Mfumwangu, ncinzi aa ta ndi goli uku ku umpilila aano? Ime ndi li litukiseze uku ku fwila.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ku ndi fwila? Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila Pitolosi, silukombwe na sini uku tungula, kuti no ndi shampule ko tatwe buti to ndi zi.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa senga-senga a bazigigwa bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Mu leke uku lekelela i myojo jenu ji li kalililwa. Mu zumine kwa Nyambe mi mu zumine kame no kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />U tumpetu ntungi mu njugo ja Tata, kali ta na ku li bulyao, na ndi la mi gambaguzi. Ndi si ka ja ndi ka mi lukiseze i cibaka. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Mi aa se ndi la ka ji ku ka mi lukiseza i cibaka, kuti na ndi ka bogole keza ku mi inda buti nenwe mu ka kale uku ndi kele. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mi inzila mu li ji zekelele iji ji ja ku cibaka uku ndi ja.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ne nzila ji ja kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi kale ga ta Jesu nage, “Mfumwetu, ta tu zekelele uku ja cwale mbuti na tu zibile inzila?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “Ndime nzila, no niti no bumi. Takuli u muntu uju a gola uku ja kwa Tata mbwita kangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ati na mwa ndi zekelela wawa, kuti na mu zekelele no Tata bulyao. Ku zwa aano, se mu li mwizi mi na mwa mu bona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipi kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwetu, u tu sunde Tata mi kwetu kuti ku jelekele.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Filipi kosini ku ndi ziba no ku na nda kala nenwe a nako inde? U muntu uju na ga ndi bona, na ga bona Tata. Mbuti aa u ta buti, ‘U tu sunde Tata’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />To zumini buti ime nkwa Tata ndi joja mi no Tata nkwangu a joja? A majwi aga ndi mi gambaguza ta li mbulyo ndi ga gambagula ko nguzu jangu kono ndi Tata uju a joja kwangu, ndege a tenda u musebezi gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mu ndi zumine aa ndi ta buti nkwa Tata ndi joja mi no Tata nage nkwangu a joja. Ati bulyao mu zumine ku bupaki bo misebezi jo mamakazo bulyo.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />“Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, uju a zumina kwangu kuti na tende i misebezi iji ka ndi tenda, mane kuti na tende i binene ku ita ibi ka ndi tenda kakuli nkwa Tata ndi ja. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Mi kuti na ndi tende i bintu byonse ibi na mu kumbile mwizina lyangu, buti Tata na lumbigwe kangu nde Mwane. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mi i cintu conse ici mu kumbila mwizina lyangu, kuti na ndi ci tende.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa kuluwiza uku keza ko Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Ati mu la ndi shaka, mu kutike i milao jangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Mi kuti na ndi kumbile Tata buti na mi we u Mutusi jumwinya uju na kalilile nenwe ku twala koko mi Moya go Niti. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />A bantu belonga ta ba goli uku mu tambula kakuli ta ba goli uku mu bona mi ta ba mwizi. Kono inwe mu li mwizi kakuli nenwe a joja mi kuti na be kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Ta na ndi mi leke sinagwe mbansigwa, kono kuti na ndi ka mi bogwele. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Se ku li sigele bulyo inako imfuwi mi ilonga ta li si ndi boni kono inwe kuti na mu ndi bone. Kakuli ndi la joja, nenwe kuti na mu joje. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mwa lelyo ijuba kuti na mu nangule buti, nkwa Tata ndi joja, nenwe nkwangu mu joja, mi neme nkwenu ndi joja. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />U muntu gense uju a kutika i milao jangu mi na tenda ubu ji co, ndege a ndi shaka. Mi uju a ndi shaka, kuti na shakigwe kwa Tata mi neme kuti na ndi mu shake na ndi li bonaaze kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judasi (isini Judasi Isikaliota) kale ga ta nage, “Mfumwangu, mbuti no li bonaalisize kwetu bulyo uku to li bonaalisi ku bantu belonga bonse?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U muntu gense uju a ndi shaka, kuti na kutike i bintu ndi ziga. Mi Tata kuti na mu shake, mi Tata neme kuti na tu keze ku joja kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />U muntu gense uju ta ndi shaki, ta kutiki a majwi gangu aga ndi ziga. A majwi mu shugwile, ta li ngangu. Nga Tata uju sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Mi nda sa mi lugwila byonse byebyo na ndi si kele nenwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />U Moya go Kucena, u Mutusi u Munene gwetu, uju na ka tume Tata mwizina lyangu, kuti na mi zige i bintu byonse no ku mi vulusa i bintu byonse ibi ka ndi mi lugwilanga.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nda sa mi leka buti mu joje nenja. Nku joja nenja ku zwa kwangu ndi mi lekela. Ta ndi mi wi ubu ba wela a bantu belonga. I myojo jenu ji leke ku li kalililwa mi mu leke uku joga. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Na mwa shugwa aa ka ndi ta buti, ‘Se ndi la ka ja kono kuti na ndi ka mi bogwele.’ Ati ka mu ndi shaka wawa, ka mu botele uku jangala aa ndi ja kwa Tata, kakuli Tata munene ku ndi ita. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ndi la mi gambaguzi aano na bi sini uku tendaala buti aa na bi tendaale na mu zumine.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />“Ta ndi si kwesi inako inde jo ku gamba i bintu i bingi kwenu, kakuli u mfumu gwa le lino ilonga sa la keza, mi ta kwesi inguzu egulu lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Kono a bantu belonga ba li botele uku li ziga buti ndi la shaka Tata mi ndi la tenda wawa i bintu ibi sa ndi laga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Mu zimane tu zwe mo muno mu cibaka.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Jesu nde cishamu wawa ca veine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Ndime cishamu wawa ca veine, mi Tata nde mwini igwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ga sa koshagula intabi jonse iji ta ji aki i biyango no ku kunkila intabi iji ji aka i biyango buti ji ake lwini. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Inwe se mu cenesegwa kwijwi ili na nda mi gambaguza. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mu kale mwangu mi neme kuti ndi kale mwenu. Takuli u lutabi lu gola uku aka i biyango na lu zwite ku cishamu, nenwe bulyao ta mu goli uku aka i biyango mbwita aa mu kala na mu joja kwangu.<figure style="fig" alt="Vine and branches" file="hk00110b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 15:1-4" ref="15:1-4">Ndime cishamu ca veine</figure><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Ndime cishamu ca veine mi inwe ndinwe ntabi. Mi u muntu aa kala na joja kwangu, neme kuti na ndi kale bu joja kwakwe. Kuti na ake lwini i biyango kakuli ku zwa kwangu ta mu goli uku tenda cimwinya. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />U muntu gense uju ta kali na joja kwangu kuti na koze u lutabi lu showigwa mi se lu la juma. Intabi ja bulyao kuti na ji gwanikigwe no ku shonjegwa mu mulilo no kuya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ati na mu kala kwangu no majwi gangu na ga kala kwenu, mu kumbile i bintu byonse ibi mu shaka, mi kuti na mu bi wegwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />I cintu ci lumba Tata, nku ta buti mu ake lwini i biyango mi mpaa na mu be a bazigigwa bangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />“Ime na nda mi shaka ubu sa ndi shakila Tata. Mu kale na ndi mi shaka bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Ati na mu kutika i milao jangu kuti mu kale na ndi mi shaka bulyao ubu ndi kalile na ndi shakigwa kwa Tata mi na ndi kutika i milao jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Na nda mi gambaguza byebi i bintu buti uku jangala kwangu ku be kwenu buti uku jangala kwenu ku vumbilile. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Indagano ndi mi laga nku ta buti, mu li shake no bamwinya ubu na nda mi shakila. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Takuli u lushako u lunene ulu lu ita u muntu uju a jonekelwa u bumi bwakwe kebaka lyo basele bakwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ndinwe basele bangu ati na mu tenda ibi ndi mi laga. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Ta ndi si mi kugi a baika, kakuli u muika ta goli uku zekelela ici a tenda mfumwe. Kono se mu li basele bangu kakuli na nda mi gambaguza i bintu byonse ibi na nda shugwa kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ta li ndinwe na mwa ndi shala, kono ndime na nda mi kuga no ku mi shala buti mu jende mu ka ake i biyango ibi na bi kalilile. Mi Tata kuti na mi we i bintu byonse ibi na mu kumbile kwakwe mwizina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ibi ndi mi laga nku ta buti, mu li shake.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">I cizimbo celonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ati a bantu belonga na ba mi zimba, mu zibe buti ndime na ba tatika uku zimba tanzi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ka li na mu li bantu ba le lino ilonga, a bantu ba le lino ilonga na ba mi shaka. Kono ta mu si li a bantu ba le lino ilonga kakuli na nda mi shala ku mi zwisa mukati ko bantu ba le lino ilonga, ndebaka ili ba mi zimbile. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Mu gaje a majwi aga se ndi mi lugwila buti, ‘Takuli u muika a ita mfumwe.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">Joani 13:16</ref>. </char></note> Ati na ba ndi pengisa, nenwe kuti na ba mi pengise. Mi ati na ba ndi shugwa, nenwe kuti na ba mi shugwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Kuti na ba mi tende byonse byebyo kebaka lyangu, kakuli ta ba zekelele uju sa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Kali ta na ndi la kezi ku ba gambaguza ta na ba kwesi u mulandu. Kono aano ta ba si goli uku shampula kebaka lyo bitendantu i bimangoju byabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />U muntu gense uju a ndi zimba, a li zimbite no Tata bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Kali ta na ndi la tendi a mamakazo mukati kabo aga ta ga la tenda u muntu, ta na ba ba no mulandu go bitendantu i bimangoju. Kono sinagwe ubu ku kalile, na ba bona a mamakazo mi kame ba si ndi zimbite ime mane no Tata bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Kono byebi bya sa vumbiliza ibi bi ñoletwe mu mulao gwabo buti, ‘Nko ku bula ne baka ba ndi zimbile.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Nimbo 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Kono ime kuti na ndi mi tumine u Moya go niti u Mutusi u Munene, uju a zwa kwa Tata mi ndege na pake byangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Mi nenwe kuti na mu pake byangu kakuli ka mu kele neme ku zwa ku matatikilo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Na nda mi gambaguza byonse byebi i bintu buti na mu leke uku joba ku zwa mu ku zumina kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Kuti na ba mi tande mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda, mi inako ji la keza a bantu na ba mi yage aa na ba gaje buti ndi Nyambe ba sebeleza. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Kuti na ba tende bulyao kakuli ta na ba zekelela Tata mane neme bulyao. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ee, nda sa mi lugwila byebi i bintu aano buti aa na bi tendaale, na mu vuluke buti se ndi mi nanguza bulyao. Ta se ndi mi lugwila ku matatikilo kakuli ka ndi si kele nenwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">U musebezi go Moya go Kucena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />“Kono aano se ndi la ka ja kwoju na ga ndi tuma, mi takuli nanga njumwinya kwenu uju a gola uku buza buti, ‘Kwibo u ja?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Mi kakuli ndi la mi gambaguzi, i myojo jenu mu nshoni se ji li. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kono mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, ncintu i cilotu kwenu aa ndi ka ja, kakuli aa ta ndi ka ji u Mutusi u Munene ta na keze kwenu. Kono ati na ndi ka ja kuti na ndi ka mu mi tumine. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Aa na sike, kuti na bonise a bantu belonga buti ba li kwesi u mulandu kebaka lyo bitendantu i bimangoju byabo, no byo ku sa tenda ubu a shakila Nyambe no byo nkatulo iji ji keza, <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />byo bitendantu i bimangoju, byo bantu kakuli ta ba zumini kwangu, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />byo ku tenda ubu a shakila Nyambe kakuli nkwa Tata ndi ja mi ta mu si ndi boni kame, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />no byo nkatulo ji keza kakuli u mfumu gwa le lino ilonga na ga atuligwa kale.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ndi si kwesi i bintu i bingi ibi ndi botele uku mi gambaguza, kono ta mu goli uku bi shugwilisa aano. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kono u Moya go niti aa na keze, kuti na mi tangilile mu niti jonse. Ta na gambange byakwe bulyo kono kuti na mi sukulwilange ibi na ga shugwa. Kuti na mi gambaguzange i bintu ibi bi si keza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ndege na ndi lumbe ko ku mi gambaguza byonse ibi na ga shugwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />I bintu byonse bya Tata mbyangu Mpaa na nda ta buti, ‘U Moya kuti na mi zibise i bintu byonse ibi na tambule kwangu.’<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uku tompa kuti na ku zoke uku jangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ku si sigalile inako imfuwi, mi ta na mu ndi bone kame, kono a nako imfuwi ku zwao, kuti na mu ndi bone.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />A bazigigwa bamwinya kale ba li buzagula mwalyabo nabo, “Ncinzi a toloka aa ta buti, ‘Mu nako imfuwi ta na mu ndi bone, kono kame kuti na mu ndi bone,’ naa la ti buti, ‘Nkwa Tata ndi ja’? <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Kame mbinzi a toloka aa ta buti, ‘Mu nako imfuwi’? Ta tu shugwilisi ibi a gambagula.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Jesu kale ga nangula buti kame ka ba shaka uku mu buza a byebyo bintu mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Kame mu li buzagula buti mbinzi ndi le ku toloka aa ndi la ti buti, ‘Mu nako imfuwi ta na mu ndi bone mi mu nako imfuwi ku zwao, kuti na mu ndi bone’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila buti, kuti na mu lile no ku tompa kwe bi na bi tendaale kwangu kono a bantu belonga kuti na ba jangale. Kuti na mu tompe kono uku tompa kwenu kuti na ku zoke uku jangala. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />U mwanakazi na shunisa a la ku shugwanga uku shisha kakuli inako jakwe jo ku bona u mucece ji la siki. Kono aa sa la boni u mucece, sa la zibala uku shisha kakuli sa la jangala buti u mucece a la bonigwa mwilonga. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nenwe bulyao, aano mu li tompete, kono kuti na ndi mi bone kame mi kuti na mu jangale, mi takuli u muntu na mi tape uku jangala kwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Mwa jejo inako ta na mu zunde uku ndi kumbila cimwinya. Mbyaconse ndi mi lugwila, Tata kuti na mi we byonse ibi na mu kumbile mwizina lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ka mu sini uku kumbila cimwinya mwizina lyangu. Mu kumbile mi kuti na mu wegwe, buti uku jangala kwenu ku vumbilile.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“No ku ka ndi gambanga mu manguli, inako ji la keza iji na ndi kane uku gamba mu manguli kono kuti na ndi mi lugwile bya Tata bu shugwaala nenja. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Momo mu nako kuti na mu kumbile mwizina lyangu. Ta ndi ti buti kuti na ndi mi kumbilile kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Inga, Tata nage a la mi shaka kakuli na mwa ndi shaka mi na mwa zumina buti nkwa Nyambe na nda zwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Na nda zwa kwa Tata keza mwilonga mi aano se ndi la zwa mwilonga ku bogola kwa Tata.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />A bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu ta nabo, “Aano so la gambagula i bintu bi shugwaala to si gambi mu manguli. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kale twa zekelela buti u li zi i bintu byonse mi takuli u muntu sa gola uku ku buzagula a mabuzi kame. Nceco ci tu zuminisa buti nkwa Nyambe u zwa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Nenwe nko ku zumina aano? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Kono inako ji la keza mi se ji li sikite aa na mu mwagale mwense, jumwinya no jumwinya ku tigila ku munzi gwakwe. Mi kuti na mu ndi leke ndenke. Kono ta na ndi kale ndenke kakuli Tata neme a kele. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Na nda mi gambaguza byonse byebyo buti mu joje nenja antu-onke neme. Mwilonga, kuti na mu be no makababu. Kono mu gongole i myojo kakuli na nda gola ilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa lapelela a bazigigwa bakwe</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku gamba byonse byebyo, kale ga ligamina kwigulu no ku lapela nage, “Tata, inako ji la siki. U lumbe Mwano buti nage na ku lumbe. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Na gwa mu wa inguzu egulu lyo bantu bonse buti a we u bumi ta bu mani ku bantu bonse aba na gwa mu wa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Mi u bumi ta bu mani nku ta buti, ba ku zibe igwe gwe Nyambe gwenke bulyo go niti, mane no Jesu Kilesite, uju na gwa tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Na nda ku lumba aano ansi ko ku mana u musebezi ugu na gwa ndi wa buti ndi gu tende. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Cwale aano Tata, u ndi pazimise ko ku ndi wa impazimo iji ka ndi kwesi na ndi si kele negwe ilonga na li si ni uku bumbigwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Tata, na nda ku ganuna ku bantu bamwinya aba na gwa ndi wa mwilonga. Ka ba li bako, mi na gwa ba ndi wa mi na ba kutika ijwi lyako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Mi aano se ba li zi buti i bintu byonse na gwa ndi wa nkwako bi zwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Na nda ba wa a majwi na gwa ndi wa, mi na ba ga tambula. Na ba ziba wawa buti nkwako na nda zwa mi na ba zumina buti ndigwe na gwa ndi tuma.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nda sa ba lapelela. Ta li mbantu belonga ndi lapelela, kono mbantu aba so ndi wa ndi lapelela kakuli mbako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />A bantu ndi kwesi bonse mbako mi a bantu bonse u kwesi na gwa ba ndi wa buti ba ndi lumbe. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Se ndi la zwa mwilonga, mi se ndi la keza kwako kono abo ba si kele mwilonga. Tata igwe u cenete, u ba unele ko nguzu jezina lyako, izina ili so ndi wa, buti bonse ba kwatisane sinagwe ubu tu kwatisanina ime negwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Aa ka ndi si kele nabo, na nda ba unela ko nguzu jezina na gwa ndi wa. Na nda ba mamela buti ku leke uku joba nanga genke, mi takuli uju na ga joba mbwita u muntu genke uju ka tungulwize ku njoneko buti ku vumbilizwe ibi na bya ñoligwa mu Mañolo.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Kono aano se ndi la keza kwako, mi na nda ba gambaguza i bintu i bingi na ndi si kele nabo mwilonga, buti ba be no ku jangala u kunene mukati kabo kebaka lyangu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Na nda ba wa ijwi lyako mi ba li zimbitwe ku bantu belonga, kakuli ta li mbatu ba le lino ilonga sinagwe ndime aa ta ndi li gwa le lino ilonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Kame ndi lapela buti u leke ku ba zwisa mo muno mwilonga, kono kame ndi lapela buti u ba mamele kwa Satani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mabuka gamwinya go Cigelike mbuti ku ñolelwe buti, “Muntu mubi”.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ta ba si li ba le lino ilonga sinagwe ndime aa ta ndi li gwa le lino ilonga. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />U ba cenese ko niti jako. Ijwi lyako ne niti. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nda sa ba tuma ku bantu belonga ubu na gwa ndi tumina neme. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Mi nda sa li cenesa ndemwini buti nabo na ba cenesegwe byaconse.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Ntali mbabo bonke ndi lapelela bulyo. Nda sa lapelela no bantu aba na ba zumine kwangu keejwi lyabo. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Tata, nda sa ba lapelela buti bonse ba be bantu bonke sinagwe ndime negwe aa tu li bantu bonke. Nabo ba kale kwetu buti a bantu belonga ba zumine buti na gwa ndi tuma.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />“Na nda ba wa impazimo iji na gwa ndi wa, buti ba be u muntu genke sinagwe ndiswe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ime ndi kale kwabo mi igwe u kale kwangu. Izo ba kwatisane wawa buti a bantu belonga ba zibe buti na gwa ndi tuma mi u la ba shaka sinagwe ubu ndi shakila. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Tata, nda sa shaka buti na ndi ka kale no bantu aba na gwa ndi wa uku ndi kele, buti ba ka bone impazimo jangu, impazimo iji na gwa ndi wa kebaka lyo ku ta buti na gwa ndi shaka ilonga na li sini uku bumbigwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />“Tata, igwe u lulikile, a bantu belonga ta na ba ku ziba, kono ime na nda ku ziba, mi no baba a bazigigwa na ba ziba nabo buti na gwa ndi tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Na nda ku zibaaza kwabo mi kuti ndi ku zibaazange bulyao buti u lushako lwako na gwa ndi shaka, lu kale kwabo mi neme ndi kale kwabo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa legezigwa no ku shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Male 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku lapela, kale ga zwamo no bazigigwa bakwe no ku shatukila mwisilya lye Lindi lya Kediloni. Kale ba ka ngina mwigwa lya Olive. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Judasi u mulegezi, ka zekelele ceco i cibaka kakuli Jesu ka jangako no bazigigwa bakwe u bungi bo nako. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bafalisi kale ba wa Judasi a kagugi ko masole no bamameli bo tempele buti ba ka je nage. Mi ka ba indite a malambi no mamuni no bilwiso. Mi kale ba ja koko kwigwa lya Olive.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Jesu, uju ka zekelele i bintu byonse ibi ka bi botele uku tendaala kwakwe, kale ga ba cengamina mi kale ga ba buza nage, “Ndini mu shaka?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ndi Jesu gwa ku munzi gwa Nanzaleta tu shaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Ndime.” (Judasi u mulegezi nabo ka zimene.) <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Jesu aa sa la gambi buti, “Ndime,” kale ba sundulukila mwishule no ku gwila ansi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Jesu kale ga ba buza kame nage, “Ndini mu shaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Kale ba mu taba kame nabo, “Ndi Jesu gwa ku munzi gwa Nanzaleta tu shaka.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Jesu kale ga ba taba nage, “Nkale ndi la mi lugwili buti Ndime, ati ndime mu shaka mu leke baba a bankosi ba ka li jile.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Kale kwa tendaala bulyao buti a majwi na ga gamba ga vumbilizwe aga ga ta buti, “Ta na nda jobelwa nanga genke ku bantu aba na gwa ndi wa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Joani 6:39</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Pitolosi, uju ka indite a kafulo a kanene, kale ga ka shomona no ku kajula u kutwi ko mulyo ko muika go mupulisiti u mukulu. Izina lya jojo u muika ndi Maluko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Kono Jesu kale ga ta Pitolosi nage, “Bogoza a kafulo kako mu cishwakalo cako! Mbuti u gajila? Ndi leke uku nywina mu cinywino co mapenzi ici na ga ndi wa Tata?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa twaligwa ku mupulisiti u mukulu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />A kagugi ko masole no mujendesi gwako no bamameli bo Majuda kale ba kwata Jesu no ku mu shumina. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Kale ba mu twala tanzi ku nkosi ka kugigwa Ana, uju ka li mukwe gwa Kayafa. Kayafa ndege ka li u mupulisiti u mukulu mwa gogo u mwaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa kame ndege sa laga a bajendesi bo Majuda buti i cintu i cilotu, muntu genke aa fwila a bantu bonse.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa shampula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Male 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Pitolosi no muzigigwa jumwinya kale ba umpilila Jesu. Jojo u muzigigwa jumwinya ndege ka zibaala ku mupulisiti u mukulu. Kale ga umpilila Jesu mane na ka ngina nage mwilapa lyo mupulisiti u mukulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Pitolosi kale ga sigala anze a cizi. Jojo u muzigigwa jumwinya uju ka zibaala ku mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga bogola no ka gambagula no muika go mukazana uju ka mamela a cizi mi kale ga nginika Pitolosi mwilapa. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Jojo u mukazana kale ga buza Pitolosi nage, “Negwe u li muzigigwa jumwinya gwa joju u muntu, indi mbuti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Inga, ta li ndi li jumwinya gwabo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kebaka lyo ku tontola, a bamameli no baika kale ba koleza u mulilo no ku li tutumunao. Pitolosi nage mpo ka zimene na li tutumuna nage.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mupulisiti u mukulu aa buzagula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Male 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />U mupulisiti u mukulu kale ga tatika uku buzagula Jesu byo bazigigwa bakwe no nzigo ka ziga. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U muntu gense a li zekelele ibi ka ndi ziga kakuli ka ndi ziga mu majugo go malapelelo go Majuda no mu tempele u mu ka ba gwananina a Majuda bonse. Takuli ibi nda la ziga mu buzinda. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ncinzi u ndi buzagwila byebyo, to buzi a bantu aba ka ba ndi shugwanga? Ba li zi ibi ka ndi gambanga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Jesu aa sa la gambi bulyao, jumwinya go bamameli bo tempele uju ka zimene afuwi kale ga mu kaba u luaka mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Ncinzi ci ku tabisa bulyao u mupulisiti u mukulu!”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “Ati ndi la gambi i cintu i cimangoju cigambaguze a bantu. Kono ati mbyaconse bulyo ndi la gambi, Ncinzi u ndi kabila?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Aobulyo, Ana kale ga shumina Jesu no ku mu tumina kwa Kayafa u mupulisiti u mukulu.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitolosi aa shampula Jesu lyabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Male 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Pitolosi aa ka si zimene na li gugumuna bulyao, kale ba mu buza nabo, “Ta li negwe u li jumwinya go bazigigwa bakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Pitolosi kale ga shampula nage, “Ta li ndi li jumwinya gwabo.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Jumwinya go baika bo mupulisiti u mukulu, mukwakwe gwa jo julya u muika na ga kajula Pitolosi u kutwi, kale ga buza Pitolosi nage, “Izo ta ndi la ka ku boni no Jesu kwigwa lya Olive?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />No ao Pitolosi kale ga shampula kame, mi aobulyo silukombwe kale ga tungula.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a nkuta jo mubusisi Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Male 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kale ba zwisa Jesu kwa Kayafa no ku mu twala kwilapa inene lyo mubusisi go Maloma. Se ka ku li a masiku-siku. A Majuda kale ba kangwa u ka ngina mwilapa lyo mfumu kebaka lyo ku joga itukuta ko cizo co milao jabo jo ku li cenesa. Kame ka ba shaka uku lya ku bilyo byo Mpaseka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilato kale ga ja anze no ka buza a bantu nage, “Milandu ja buti na ga tenda joju unkosi iji mu mu zekiseza?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Ta na tula mu leti kwako ka li takuli ici na la tendi i cimangoju.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu mu inde mu ka mu zekise ku umpilila ubu gu co u mulao gwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">A Bajendesi bo Majuda kale ba mu taba nabo, “Iswe ta tu kwesi inguzu jo ku yaga u muntu.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />(Kale kwa tendaala bulyao ku vumbiliza ibi sa gamba Jesu ku ja ko bu ka botele uku fwila.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:32-33">Joani 12:32-33</ref>. </char></note>)<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Cwale Pilato kale ga bogola kwilapa inene mi kale ga kuga Jesu no ku mu buza nage, “Ndigwe Mfumu go Majuda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ndigwe bulyo u buza bulyao kampa mbantu na ba ku lugwila byangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato kale ga taba nage, “Ime ta ndi li Mujuda, kono mbakwako no mapulisiti a bakulu ba la ku leti kwangu. Ncinzi na gwa tenda?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “U mubuso gwangu ta li gwa le lino ilonga. Ka li na ngwa le lino ilonga a baumpilili bangu na ba la ndi lwili buti a Majuda ba leke ku ndi shumina. Kono u mubuso gwangu ta li ngwa le lino ilonga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Aobulyo, Pilato kale ga ta nage, “Cwale u li Mfumu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “U la gambi nenja, ndi li Mfumu bulyao u la teli. Nceco na nda bonenwa mwilonga buti ndi keze ndi pake initi. Mi u muntu gense uju a kwesi initi ga sa ndi shugwa.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato kale ga mu buza nage, “Initi ncinzi?” Aa sa la gambi bulyao, Pilato kale ga zwila anze no ka ta a Majuda nage, “Ta ndi la gwani u mulandu ndi botele uku mu atwila. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Kono inwe mu li kwesi i cizo co ku mi lukulwilanga u muntu genke mu ntolongo a nako jo Mpaseka. Mu la shaka buti ndi lukulule ‘u Mfumu go Majuda’?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />A bantu kale ba kumbagana nabo, “Inga, jojo nyaa! Ndi Bbalabbasi tu shaka!” Mi Bbalabbasi ka li cijoni.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa atwilwa u lufu</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Cwale Pilato kale ga ta buti Jesu a shapigwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />A masole kale ba zinga i miga ku tenda sinagwe nciusi co mfumu no ku ci mu tula ku mutwi mi kale ba mu jabika u mukanjo go mubala go nzilu. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Kale ba keza kwakwe no ku mu nyungulula nabo, “Oosho, mfumu go Majuda!” Kale ba mu kaba ku mensho.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato kale ga zwila anze kame mi kale ga ta a Majuda nage, “Nga mu lole, kuti ndi mu mi letele buti mu zibe buti takuli u mulandu ndi la mu gwanini.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Jesu kale ga zwila anze na jabele u mukanjo go mubala go nzilu no ciusi co miga mi Pilato kale ga ta a bantu nage, “Nga mu lole, uju ndege!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />A mapulisiti a bakulu no bamameli bo tempele aa ba mu bona, kale ba kumbagana nabo, “U mu kankamine! U mu kankamine!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Kono Pilato kale ga ba taba nage, “Ime ndi la gwani buti ta kwesi u mulandu, mu mu inde mwebeni mu ka mu kankamine.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />A Majuda kale ba indikila nabo, “Ko mulao gwetu, a li botele uku fwa kakuli ka li kuganga buti ndi Mwana Nyambe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga joga lwini wawa, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />mi kale ga bogoza Jesu mu njugo mi kale ga mu buza nage, “Kwibo u zwa?” Kono Jesu kale ga ombelela bulyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato kale ga mu ta nage, “Ncinzi aa u kana uku gamba neme? To nanguli buti ndi li kwesi inguzu jo ku ku lukulula kampa jo ku ku kankamina.?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Jesu kale ga mu taba nage, “To no la kwati nanga mpace inguzu egulu lyangu kali ta li ndi Nyambe na la ji ku wi. Kebaka lelyo, uju na ga ndi leta mu nguzu jako a li kwesi u mulandu u munene go bitendantu i bimangoju.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Aobulyo Pilato kale ga jeleka uku mu shumununa, kono a Majuda kale ba kumbagana lwini nabo, “Ati no lukulula joju unkosi, to si li musele gwa Sesale. Kakuli u muntu gense uju a li kuga buti nu mfumu ga sa lwisa Sesale.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato aa shugwa bulyao, kale ga zwisikiza Jesu anze mi Pilato kale ga kala mu cikalo co buatuli ici ka ci li a cibaka ci kugigwa “Inkanza jo mabwe ga jalamite nenja,” kampa Gabbata mu mushobo go Ciebelu. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Inako se ka ji shaka uku ba 12 jo kamwi, mi ka lili ijuba lyo ku litukiseza ijuba lyo Mpaseka. Pilato kale ga ta a Majuda nage, “Uju nde mfumwenu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Kono kale ba kumbagana nabo, “U mu yage! U mu yage! U mu kankamine!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato kale ga ba buza nage, “Ndi kankamine mfumwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">A mapulisiti a bakulu kale ba taba nabo, “Ta tu kwesi u mfumu jumwinya mbwita Sesale.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Ao Pilato kale ga ba wa Jesu buti ba ka mu Kankamine a cifapaano.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jesu aa kankaminwa a cifapaano</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Male 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:16">Mi a masole kale ba inda Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Jesu kale ga koleka i cifapaano cakwe mi kale ga ja ku cibaka ci kugigwa “I cibaka co katendele” (ici ci kugigwa Gologota mu Ciebelu). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Koko kale ba ka kankamina Jesu a cifapaano no bankosi bo bile, jumwinya ko ku jumwinya ko ku, Jesu mukati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato kale ga ñola inzibiso no ku ji angika a cifapaano. Ici na ga ñola nca ku ta buti, “<char style="sc">Jesu gwa mu munzi gwa Nanzaleta, u Mfumu go Majuda</char>.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />U bungi bo Majuda kale ba bala jejo inzibiso kakuli i cibaka aa na ba ka kankamina Jesu ka ci li afuwi no munzi gwa Jelusalema. Mi inzibiso ka ji ñoletwe mu Ciebelu no Cilatini no Cigelike buti a bantu a bangi ba gole uku balao.<verse eid="JHN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />A mapulisiti a bakulu, kale ba ta Pilato nabo, “U leke uku ñola bulyao buti ‘U Mfumu go Majuda’ kono u ñole buti, ‘Mbuti ka telanga buti Ndime Mfumu go Majuda.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato kale ga ba taba nage, “Ibi ndi la mani uku ñola, nela ndi la ñoli.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />A masole aa se ba la mani uku kankamina Jesu, kale ba li taila i bizwato byakwe. Kale ba inda no mukanjo gwakwe ugu ta gu kwesi u muluko ka gu sumitwe ku zwa kwigulu keza ansi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />A masole kale ba li ta nabo, “Tu leke uku gu ñatula, ndokweni tu tende iñeela mi uju sa ka ji tunge ndege sa ka gu inde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Kale kwa tendaala bulyao ku vumbiliza a Mañolo aga ga ta buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Na ba li taangila i bizwato byangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">mi na ba tenda iñeela a mukanjo gwangu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Nimbo 22:18</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Mi a masole mbe bintu na ba tenda.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Afuwi no cifapaano ca Jesu, ka ku zimene nyina, no nyina-gana (uju ka li mwancegwe gwa nyina), no Maliya muka Kilopa, no Maliya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Jesu aa bona nyina a zimene afuwi no muzigigwa uju ka shaka, kale ga ta nyina nage, “Maa, ujo nde mwano.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Mi kale ga ta no jojo u muzigigwa gwakwe nage, “Ujo nde nyoko.” Ku zwao bulyo, jojo u muzigigwa kale ga mu inda buti a kakalange kwilapa lyakwe.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on cross speaks to John and Mary" file="cn01840b.jpg" size="col" loc="Jhn 19:25-27" copy="Cook" ref="19:25-27">Jesu aa gamba no nyina no Joani na li a cifapaano</figure><verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa fwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Male 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Jesu ko ku ziba buti i bintu byonse se bi li manite, mi buti ibi na bya ñolegwa bi tendaale, kale ga ta buti, “Ni nyotwa ndi shugwile.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ao mpo ka ku ninzi a kazunga u mu kakuli waine go ku lyelyeta. Kale ba cumpwikamo i ciponci no ku ci shomeka ku kashamu ka isopa no ku nanwina ku kanwa ka Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Jesu aa sa la mani uku nywa, kale ga ta nage, “Ku la mani.” Aa sa la ti bulyao, kale ga sungama no ku maninwa u muuja gwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Lelyo se ka lili ijuba lyo ku litukisa, mi a bajendesi bo Majuda ta ka ba shaka buti byebyo i bitupu bi kale na bi anzi a bifapaano mwijuba lyo Nsabata. (Kalili lyo Nsabata lyo butokwa mi ka ji li Mpaseka). Kale ba kumbila Pilato buti i bitupu bi colaguligwe a matende no ku susigwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />A masole kale ba cola a matende go nkosi gwe tanzi no gwa bili aba na ba kankaminwa no Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Kono aa ba keza kwa Jesu, kale ba bona buti kale ga fwa. Mi ta na ba colagula a matende gakwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nanganceciba bulyao, jumwinya go masole kale ga weja Jesu u lukwengo ku mpati, mi wangu-wangu kale kwa zwa a malowa no menzi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Unkosi uju na ga bi bona byebi, ndege na ga bi paka, mi u bupaki bwakwe mbwa conse. Ige a li zi buti ni niti a gamba mi ga sa paka initi buti mu zumine. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Byonse byebyo kale bya tendaale buti a Mañolo ga vumbilizwe aga ga ta buti, “Takuli i cifuwa cakwe ici na ci coligwe.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Lujendo 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Mapalo 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Nimbo 34:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Sinagwe ubu li co limwinya iñolo buti, “Kuti na ba mu lolelele uju na ba weja.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakaliya 12:10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa bikigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Male 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Mwishule lya byebyo, Josefa gwa mu munzi gwa Alimateya, kale ga kumbila Pilato buti a inde i citupu ca Jesu. Josefa ka li muzigigwa gwa Jesu mu buzinda kebaka lyo ku joga a Majuda. Pilato aa sa la mu zuminini, Josefa kale ga ka inda i citupu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Kale ga ka ja no Nekudema, unkosi uju sa ka potela Jesu a masiku mu majuba ga mu mashule. Nekudema kale ga inda a mafuta ga kugigwa i mila no alowe aga ga tula lwini go bulemenezi bu shaka uku sika a makilo go makumi go tatwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Kale ba inda i citupu ca Jesu no ku ci vungila mu masila, ku gwanikilila no mafuta bulyao. Kale ba tenda bulyao ku umpilila u muzikilo go cizo co Majuda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />I cibaka aa na ba kankaminina Jesu a cifapaano, mpo kakuli igwa u mu kakuli ibita u mu ka ku sini uku bikigwa u muntu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Mi kakuli se ka lili Ijuba lyo Bulitukiso lyo Majuda kame nebita mpafuwi ka lili, kale ba lalikamo Jesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Imbuko ja Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Male 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />A masiku-siku ge juba lyetanzi lyo nsunda, na ku si siite, Maliya Magadalena kale ga keza kwibita. Kale ga gwana buti ibwe na ba fwinka kwibita na lya zwisigwako. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kale ga tigilila kwa Simoni Pitolosi no muzigigwa jumwinya, uju ka shakigwa kwa Jesu no ka ba ta nage, “Ba la indi i citupu co Mfumu mwibita, mi ta twi zi uku ba la ci tuli!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Pitolosi no muzigigwa jumwinya, kale ba ja kwibita. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />U bubili bwabo kame ka ba tiga kono jojo u muzigigwa kale ga suta Pitolosi no ka tangila u ka sika ebita. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Kale ga kotama no ku enja mwibita mi kale ga bona a masila ga lele bulyo kono kale ga kangwa uku nginamo. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Pitolosi aa ka sika kale ga ngina mwibita mi kale ga bona a masila na ga lele ansi. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Isila ili na ba zinga Jesu ku mutwi na li bungitwe mi na li lele kumbali lyonke ku zwa kwa gamwinya. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />U muzigigwa uju na ga tangila ka sika kwibita, kale ga ngina mukati nage mi kale ga bona no ku zumina. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />No mwa jejo inako a bazigigwa ka ba sini uku shugwilisa a Mañolo buti Jesu ka botele uku buka ku zwa ku bafu. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Babo a bazigigwa kale ba bogola uku ka ba kala.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Male 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Kono Maliya kale ga sigala na zimene anze jebita na lila. Aa ka kwesi uku lila bulyao, kale ga kotama no ku enja mwibita. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Kale ga bona a mañiloi go bile ga jabele byo ku tuba na ga kele aa ka ci li i citupu ca Jesu, limwinya na li kalile ku mutwi limwinya ku matende. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />A mañiloi kale ga mu buza nago, “Mwanakazi, ncinzi u lila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Maliya kale ga taba nage, “Ba la indi Mfumwangu mi ta ndi zi uku ba la mu tuli.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga bona Jesu na zimene ao kono ta na ga ziba buti ndi Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Jesu kale ga mu buza nage, “Mwanakazi, ncinzi u lila? Ndini u shaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Maliya kale ga gaja buti nde mwini igwa mi kale ga mu ta nage, “Ati ndigwe u la mu indimo, u ndi lugwile uku u la ka mu tuli buti ndi ka mu inde.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Jesu kale ga mu kuga nage, “Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Maliya kale ga taba mu mushobo go Ciebelu nage, “Labbuni!” (ku toloka buti “Muzigi”).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U leke uku ndi kwata, kakuli ndi sini ku bogwela tanzi kwa Tata. U ka je tanzi ku bakwangu u ka ba lugwile buti, ‘Ndi si ja kwa Tata uju a li senu no kwa Nyambe gwangu, uju a li Nyambe gwenu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Maliya Magadalena kale ga ja ku bazigigwa no ka ba gambaguza nage, “Ndi la boni u Mfumu!” Mi kale ga ba sukulwila ibi na ga mu gambaguza.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza ku bazigigwa bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Male 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />A matengu ga lelyo ijuba lyetanzi lyo nsunda, a bazigigwa ka ba gwanene antu-onke mu njugo. Ka ba galite no ku ata ku bizi kebaka lyo ku joga a Majuda. Jesu kale ga keza ku zimana mukati kabo mi kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu joje nenja!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Aa sa la gambi bulyao, kale ga ba sunda mu maganja gakwe no ku mpati. A bazigigwa kale ba jangala aa ba bona Mfumwabo. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Jesu kale ga ba ta kame nage, “Mu joje nenja! Sinagwe ubu na ga ndi tumina Tata, neme nda sa mi tuma bulyao.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Mi kale ga ba fuzilila egulu lyabo mi kale ga ta nage, “Mu tambule u Moya go Kucena. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ati na mu kwatila a bantu i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo, kuti na ba kwatilwe. Mi ati ta mu kwatili a bantu i bitendantu i bimangoju byabo, ta na ba kwatilwe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza kwa Tomasi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi (uju ka kugigwa Didima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tomasi ndizina lya mu mushobo go Cialamaiki no Cigelike mi ndizina li toloka “Go majovu”.</char></note>), jumwinya go bazigigwa be kumi no bo bile, ta ka ku li ku bazigigwa bamwinya Jesu aa na ga keza. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kale ba mu lugwila nabo, “Tu la boni Mfumwetu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Kono ige kale ga taba nage, “Ati ta ndi boni u mu na kwa nginina i bipikili mu maganja gakwe no ku nginikamo u munwe umu nakwa nginina i bipikili, mane no ku kwata ne ganja mwibatila lya nkumpati jakwe, ta na ndi zumine.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Aa se ku la iti a majuba ga 8, a bazigigwa kale ba gwanana kame, mi momo mu nako no Tomasi mpo ka li. No ku ka ba atite i bizi, Jesu kale ga keza ku zimana mukati kabo no ku ba ta nage, “Mu joje nenja!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Kale ga ta Tomasi nage, “Tula u munwe gwako momu, igwe u lole a maganja gangu. Golola iganja lyako u kwate no mwibatila lya nkumpati jangu. U leke uku mamanya, u zumine.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi kale ga mu taba nage, “Mfumwangu no Nyambe gwangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U la zumini kebaka lyo ku ta buti u la ndi boni, imfwijaguzi nja bantu aba ba zumina no ku ta ba la boni.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">U mugajalo gwa leli ibuka</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Jesu na ga tenda i bijuliko ibi bi makaza i bingi a bazigigwa bakwe na ba mu wene ibi ta na bya ñolegwa momu mwibuka. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Kono byebi na bya ñolegwa, izo mu zumine buti Jesu nde Mushaligwa, mi nde Mwana Nyambe, mi ko ku zumina mu gwane u bumi mwizina lyakwe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aa li bonaaza ku bazigigwa <optbreak />ekamba lyeziba</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mwishule lya byebyo, Jesu kale ga li bonaaza ku bazigigwa bakwe kame, ekamba lyeziba lya Tibbeliyasi. Kale ga li bonaaza kwabo buti, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Pitolosi, Tomasi (uju ka kugigwa Didima), Natanaele gwa mu munzi gwa Kana gwa mwilonga lya Galileya, no bana ba Zebedeya mane no bazigigwa bamwinya bo bile.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga ta bagenze nage, “Nku ku yamba inswi ndi ja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Abo kale ba mu ta nabo, “Neswe se tu la ka ja negwe.” Kale ba ka ngina mu bwato kono gago a masiku gonse ta na ba kwata cimwinya.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />A masiku-siku, ijuba aa se lila ñatuli, Jesu kale ga keza ku zimana ekamba, kono a bazigigwa ta na ba mu ziba buti ndi Jesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Kale ga ba kuga nage, “Basele bangu, ta mu kwesi inswi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Kale ba mu taba nabo, “Takuli.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu shonjele u tunyandi ku lubazu lyo mulyo lo bwato mi kuti mu kwate.” Kale ba shonjela u tunyandi, mi kale ba kangwa uku tu jambula kebaka lyo bungi boonswi iji na ba kwata.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus meets his disciples" file="lb00330b.jpg" size="span" loc="Jhn 21:4-6" ref="21:4-6">Jesu aa li gwana no bazigigwa bakwe</figure><verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Cwale u muzigigwa uju ka shakigwa lwini kwa Jesu, kale ga ta Pitolosi nage, “Ni Mfumwetu!” Pitolosi aa shugwa buti ni Mfumwabo, kale ga li shumina u mukanjo gwakwe (kakuli kame ka jabwile) no ku shotokela mu menzi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />A bazigigwa bamwinya kale ba mu umpilila na ba li mu bwato na ba koka a kanyandi aka ka ka vumbite inswi, kakuli ta ka ba li u kule lwini ne kamba ka ji li milyatilo bulyo ja 100 ku ja ekamba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Aa ba ka sika ekamba, kale ba bona iziko nonswi a babigwao kale ba bona no buobe.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu lete kunswi jimwinya iji mu zwa uku kwata.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Pitolosi kale ga ja mu bwato no ka kokela a kanyandi ekamba, aka ka ka vumbite inswi inene. Inswi ka ji sika a 153 kono a kanyandi ta na ka ñatuka.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Jesu kale ga ba ta nage, “Mu keze mu lisuke.” Kwa babo a bazigigwa, takuli uju ka gola uku mu buza buti, “Ndigweni?” Na ba mu ziba buti ndi Mfumwabo. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Jesu kale ga keza, mi kale ga inda u buobe no ku bu ba wa mane kale ga tenda bulyao no kunswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Jejo kale ja ba inako ja tatu, iji na ga li bonaaza Jesu ku bazigigwa bakwe ku zwa aa na ga busigwa ku zwa ku bafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu no Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Aa se ba la mani uku lya, Jesu kale ga buza Simoni Pitolosi nage, “Simoni mwana Joani, izo u la ndi shaka lwini ku ita baba bonse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Ee, Mfumwangu, u li zi buti ndi la ku shaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U lise ingu-gana jangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Jesu kale ga mu buza kame nage, “Simoni mwana Joani, izo u la ndi shaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Pitolosi kale ga taba nage, “Ee, Mfumwangu, u li zi buti ndi la ku shaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U babalele ingu jangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Jesu kale ga mu buza kame lya tatu nage, “Simoni mwana Joani, izo u la ndi shaka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pitolosi kale ga tompa kakuli Jesu na ga mu buza lya tatu buti, “Izo u la ndi shaka?” Kale ga taba nage, “Mfumwangu, u li zi i bintu byonse, u li zi buti ndi la ku shaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U lise ingu jangu.<verse eid="JHN 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />“Mbyaconse ndi ku lugwila buti, aa ko sili mwanuke ko gola uku li shumina u lukaku gwemwini no ku lijila konse uku ko shaka. Kono aa no kalampae, kuti no golole a maganja gako mi jumwinya kuti na ku shumine u lukaku no ku ku twala uku to shaki uku ja.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabuka gamwinya mbuti ku ñolelwe buti “ko li zwatika gwemwini” mi kame ku li ñoletwe buti, “u muntu jumwinya kuti na ku zwatike.”</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Jesu kale ga ta bulyao ku sunda buti ndufu lwa buti Pitolosi ulu na lumbe Nyambe kalo. Mi Jesu kale ga mu ta nage, “U ndi umpilile.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Pitolosi kale ga litemuna, mi kale ga bona u muzigigwa uju ka shakigwa lwini kwa Jesu na ba umpilile. (Jojo u muzigigwa, ndege ka zendamine Jesu aa ka ba lya u mulalilo, mi kale ga buza Jesu buti, “Mfumwetu, ndini na ku legeze?”) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Pitolosi aa mu bona, kale ga buza nage, “Mfumwangu, inga joju?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Jesu kale ga taba nage, “Ati na ndi shaka buti a joje ku twala aa na ndi ka bogwele, mbya cinzi byebyo kwako? Igwe u ndi umpilile.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Gogo u mugambilo, kale gwa jandulukila ku bazigigwa bonse buti, jojo u muzigigwa ta na fwe. Kono Jesu ta ka ta buti ta na fwe, kono kame ka ta buti, “Ati na ndi shaka buti a joje ku twala aa na ndi ka bogwele, mbya cinzi byebyo kwako?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Jojo u muzigigwa ndege ka paka byebi i bintu mi ndege na ga bi ñola mi tu li zi buti u bupaki bwakwe mbwa conse.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Jesu sa tenda i bintu bimwinya i bingi kame. Ka li na bi la ñolegwa byonse mu mabuka, ndi la gaja buti nanga ndilonga lyonse ta na kwa gwanaala u mu ka ba ga tula.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>